<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Kâboutpoenae</book>
  <para style="h">Kâboutpoenae</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kâboutpoenae</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kâboutpoenae</para>
  <para style="mt">Kâboutpoenae</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kahrawngum, Jordan palang teng, Shuph khopui, Paran khopui, Tophel khopui, Hazeroth, Dizahab khopuinaw koevah, Mosi ni Isarelnaw koe bout a dei e lawk teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kadeshbarnea hateh, Seir mon lam lahoi Horeb e a onae hoi hnin 11 lamcei ahla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi ni Heshbon khopui kaawm e, Amor Siangpahrang Sihon thoseh, Edrei ram, Ashtaroth khopui kaawm e Bashan siangpahrang Og thoseh, a thei hnukkhu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum 40 thapa yung 11 apasuek hnin dawk Moab ram
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan palang teng vah, Cathut ni lawk a poe tangcoung e patetlah Isarelnaw koe bout a dei e kâlawk hateh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni, Horeb hmuen dawk, na dei pouh e teh, nangmouh ni atueng a kuep ditouh hete mon dawk na o awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kamlang awh nateh bout kamthaw awh haw. Amor mon totouh thoseh, hote mon hoi kahnai e hmuen tanghling, akalah, tuipui teng, Kanaan ram, Lebanon mon, Euphrates tuipui totouh cet awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote ram teh nangmouh hmalah ka hruek toe. Cathut ni, nangmae na pa Abraham, Isak, Jakop koehoi kamtawng teh a catounnaw ka poe han telah lawk a kam e ram hah kâen nateh coe awh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatnavah, Kai ni nangmouh koe ka dei e thaw heh ka madueng ka phawt thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh na pung sak awh vaiteh, nangmouh teh kalvan âsi patetlah sahnin na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmae na pa BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh teh alet 1000 lahoi na pung sak naseh. Lawk a kam e patetlah yawhawi na poe a seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tawntamnae, thawtawknae, kâyuekâounnae hnokari kai ka madueng ni bangtelamaw ka phu thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lungkaangnaw, ka thaipanueknaw, hoi ka thoumthainaw hah na miphun thung hoi rawi awh. Ahnimanaw hah ka hrawikung lah ka hruek han telah dei awh pawteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nangmouh ni, na dei e patetlah ahawi telah bout a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah na miphunnaw dawk mitkhet kamcu e kacuenaw panuenae ka tawn naw ka rawi hnukkhu nangmouh koe kacue thaw ka tawk hanelah 1,000 ka uk hane, 100 ka uk hane, 50 ka uk hane, 10 ka uk hane ukkungnaw hah ka rawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lawkcengkungnaw hai, na hmaunawnghanaw e kamcan hah a thai awh vaiteh, hmaunawngha reira e kamcan thoseh, Jentelnaw hoi e kamcan thoseh kalancalah lawkceng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lawkcengnae dawkvah, apie minhmai hai khen hanh. Camo e lawk hah kacue e lawk patetlah pouk. Apihai taket hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, lawkcengnae teh Cathut e doeh. Na dei thai hoeh e kamcan hah kai koe thokhai awh. Kai ni hai ka thai han telah lawk a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na sak awh hane naw hai hatnavah kâ na poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaimouh ni Horeb hmuen koehoi ka tâco awh teh, Amor mon totouh ceinae lam teng vah, takikathopounge kahrawngum ka cei awh teh Kadeshbarnea hmuen koe ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />BAWIPA ni kâ na poe e patetlah hatnavah kai nihai, maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe awh e Amor mon vah nangmouh ni na pha awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni ram kahawi teh nangmouh hmalah ka hruek toe. Nangmae napanaw e BAWIPA ni a dei e patetlah cet awh nateh lawm awh, taket awh hanh, na lung hai pout awh hanh telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatnavah nangmanaw pueng ni kai koe na tho awh teh, kaimae hmalah taminaw ka patoun han. Ahnimouh ni hote ram hah a rip awh hnukkhu, kaimouh teh nâ lam cet pawiteh, bang khopui dawk pha awh han doeh telah a dei awh han telah a dei awh e heh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kai ni ka ngai dawkvah miphun buet touh dawk tami buet touh, asumkum 12 touh hah na rawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni mon koe lah a kamlang awh teh Eshkol tanghling koe a pha awh teh a tuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hote ram dawk e a paw a hrawm awh teh a thokhai navah, maimae Cathut ni na poe e ram teh kahawi e ram doeh telah a dei awh eiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cet awh laipalah, namamae BAWIPA Cathut e kâ na ek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cathut ni maimouh na hmuhma teh raphoe sak han na ngai awh dawkvah, Amornaw e kut dawk na poe hanlah, Izip ram hoi na tâcokhai awh khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Maimouh ni bangtelamaw cei awh han toung, hmaunawnghanaw ni hote kho dawk e taminaw teh maimouh hlak a len awh. A rasang poung awh. Kalvan ka deng e khopui, rapan hai ao. Hote kho dawk Anakim miphunnaw ka hmu awh telah maimae lungthin a raphoe toe telah nangmouh ni rimnaw dawk na taran awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hatnavah kai ni, puen hanh awh, ahnimouh taket a hanh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangmae hmalah ka cet e nangmae Cathut ni na hmalae Izip ram hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nangmouh ni na dawn e lam, hete hmuen totouh a na pa ni a ca a tapam e patetlah nangmae Cathut ni nangmouh na tapam teh, lungmanae na coenae kahrawng hai thoseh, nangmouh han a sak e patetlah nangmouh koe lah taran na kabawp awh han telah a dei nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />nangmouh ni rim tumpup nahan hmuen tawng awh nateh na cei awh nahan lam na patue hanelah karum vah hmai dawk thoseh, khodai lah tâmai dawk thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />nangmae hmalah ka cet e Cathut e lawk hah hote kong dawk nangmouh ni na yuem awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nangmae lawk Cathut ni a thai nah a lungkhuek teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ahnimae mintoenaw ka poe han ka tie ka lawkkam ram kahawi hah Jephunneh capa Kalep hloilah hete kathoute Miphunnaw buet touh ni boehai kâen awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahni teh Cathut e hnuk roup a kâbang dawk a kâen. A coungroe e ram hah ahni koehoi kamtawng teh ahnie catounnaw ka poe han telah lawk ka kam .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahnimouh han Cathut ni, kai koehai a lungkhuek, nang teh hote ram na coe mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na kut rahim e Nun capa Joshua ni a coe han. Ahni teh Isarelnaw râw ka coe sak hanelah ao dawk. Ahni hah thapoe haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Taran ni a lawp e lah ao han na ti awh e camonaw, hatnavah thoe hoi hawi kapek thai hoeh rae canu capanaw ni, hote ram a coe awh vaiteh, kai ni ka poe e patetlah a lawp awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangmouh teh na kamlang awh vaiteh tuipuipaling lam lahoi kahrawng lah bout cet awh ei telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nangmouh ni hai, kaimouh ni Cathut hah koe ka payon awh toe. Maimae Cathut ni lawk na thui awh e patetlah atu cei awh vaiteh taran tuk han telah na dei pouh teh, tami pueng puengcang rip a patuep awh teh, mon lah takhang hanelah coungkacoe ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cathut ni hai tuk awh hanh, nangmouh koe lah kai kaawm hoeh, na tuk awh pawiteh taran hmalah na sung awh han telah kai ni ka dei e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />kai ni ka dei nakunghai nangmouh ni na tarawi awh hoeh. Cathut e kâ eknae hoi mon lah na luen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hatnavah mon dawkvah la kaawm e Amor miphunnaw ni nangmouh koe lah a tâco teh, khoi ni a rongyawn e patetlah nangmouh na kayo awh teh Seir hoi Hormah khopui totouh na thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nangmouh hai bout na tho awh teh, Cathut hmalah na khui na ka awh. Hatei nangmae na lawk hah Cathut ni thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Kadesh hmuen dawk yampa na o awh e patetlah moi ka saw lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cathut ni kai koe bout a dei e patetlah kaimouh ni kamlang awh vaiteh, Tuipui paling kahrawng lahoi ka cei teh Seir mon hah moi ka saw lah ka lawngven awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut nihai, nangmouh ni atueng akuep nahan hete mon hah na lawngven awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atunglah bout cet awh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang ni tami pueng koe na dei pouh hane teh, na hmau Esaw miphunnaw a onae Seir ram teng vah, nangmouh na cei awh toteh ahnimouh ni a taki awh han. Hatdawkvah kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rek saueng hanh awh. Ahnimae ram hah, kai ni nangmouh na poe hoeh. Na coungroenae khok hmuen tittouh hai na poe hoeh. Seir mon hateh Esaw yo ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na canei nahane bu hoi tui hai thoseh, ahnimouh koe tangka hoi na ran awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na tawksaknae pueng dawk, nangmae Cathut ni yawhawinae a poe toe. Hete kahrawngpui dawk nangmouh na lawngven awh e a kongnaw a panue. A kum 40 touh thung nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh hoi cungtalah ao nah, banghai nangmouh dawk panki hoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Seir ram kaawm e maimae hmau Esaw miphun koe cei awh teh, Elath khopui Eziongeber khopui hoi ka cet e lam tâphai koe ka dawn awh teh, haw hoi bout kamlang awh teh Moab kahrawng lam lahoi ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut nihai, Moab khocanaw rucat poe awh hanh, tuk awh hanh, ahnimae ram kai ni na poe awh hoeh. Arab ram teh Lot miphunnaw kai ni yo ka poe toe telah ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ayan vah Anakim miphun patetlah ka rasang kalen e Em miphunnaw teh hote ram dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh, Anakim miphunnaw patetlah ao e lah a pouk awh. Hatnavah Moab ram khocanaw ni ahnimanaw teh EM telah a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ayan vah Hor taminaw teh Seir ram vah ao awh. Ahnimouh hah Esaw miphunnaw ni a thei awh teh, ahnimouh onae hmuen dawk ao awh. Hot patetlah Cathut ni a poe e ram hah Isarel miphunnaw ni ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu cet awh nateh Zered tui rakat awh haw telah a dei e patetlah Ahnimouh ni Zered tui a raka awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kadeshbarnea hmuen koe ahmaloe phanae tueng koehoi ka tâco awh teh Zered tui rakanae tueng totouh kum 38 touh a ro. Cathut ni lawk a kam e patetlah ahmaloe e taran ka tuk thai e ransanaw pueng teh taminaw thungup hoi a due awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahnimouh raphoe hoeh roukrak, Cathut ni ahnimouh koehoi pâmit hanelah a kut a dâw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Taran ka tuk thai e pueng tamihu thung e koung a pâmit sak hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut ni nang teh Moab ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ar ram a lungui vah sahnin na cei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ammon miphunnaw teng na pha torei teh ahnimouh rucatnae poe awh hanh, reksaueng awh hanh. Ammon miphunnaw a onae ram hah kai ni nangmouh koe na poe hoeh. Hote ram teh Lot miphunnaw kai ni ka poe toe telah kai koe a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hote ram hai kalenpounge taminaw e hmuen doeh telah taminaw ni a pouk awh. Ayan e tueng dawk, hot patetlae taminaw ni ao awh. Ahnimouh hah Ammon ram khocanaw ni Zamzummim telah a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote miphun teh Anakim miphunnaw patetlah kalenpoung kapap poung e taminaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei Seir ram dawk kaawm e Esaw miphun e hmalah Hor taminaw hah Cathut ni a raphoe dawkvah, ahnimae hmuen dawk Esaw miphunnaw ni sahnin totouh ao e patetlah koung a pâmit teh ahnimae hmuen dawk Arnonnaw ni ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hot patetlah Hazrim khopui koehoi Gaza khopui totouh ouk kaawm e naw Avvimnaw hai Kaptor khopui ka tâcawt e Kaptor taminaw ni a raphoe awh teh, ahnimanaw a onae hmuen dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangmouh na thaw awh vaiteh cet awh haw, Arnon tuipui raka awh haw. Amor miphun, Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon hoi a talai hah nangmae kut dawk ka poe toung dawkvah, khosak awh nateh hote bawi hah tuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tâmai rahim kaawm e pueng, miphunnaw ni sahnin nangmouh tâsue taki laihoi ao nahan ka sak han. Nangmae kamthang a thai awh vaiteh, puennae, pâyawnae, runae puenghoi a kâhmo awh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kai hai Kedemoth kahrawng hoi Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon koevah patounenaw ka patoun vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aram lungui vah na cetsak haw, na lam dawk dueng ka dawn han. Avoilah aranglah ka phen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Seir ram kaawm e Esaw miphun, Ar ram dawk kaawm e Moab miphunnaw ni kai dawk a sak awh e patetlah ka ca hane rawca thoseh, nei hane tui hai thoseh, tangka hoi yawt lawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kai teh Cathut ni na poe e ram lah Jordan palang ka raka vaiteh ka pha hoehroukrak Seir ram lungui dawk khok hoi ka cet haw nei telah kâhuikonae lawk hoi ka dei nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kaimouh ka cei nahane Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon ni kâ na poe hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, sahnin kamnue e patetlah nangmae Cathut ni hote siangpahrang nangmae kut dawk na poe hanelah, lung a tha o sak, lungpatanae lungthin a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cathut ni hai Sihon siangpahrang hoi a talai hah na poe han. Hote talai hah râw lah na pang hanelah lat lawih telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatnavah, Sihon siangpahrang teh amae tami puenghoi Jahaz vah maimanaw na tuk hanelah a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Maimae Cathut ni hote siangpahrang hah maimouh koe na poe teh, ama hoi a canaw hoi tami pueng ka thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatnavah ahnie khopui pueng ka tuk awh teh, napui tongpa, camonaw buet touh hai hlung laipalah koung ka pâmit awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saringnaw, khopui dawk e hnopainaw dueng kamamouh hanlah ka la pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon tuipui teng kaawm e Aroer khopui hoi Gilead khopui totouh, tuipui teng kaawm e pueng khopuinaw thung, ka tâ thai hoeh e buet touh hai khopui awm hoeh. Maimae Cathut ni a cawngca pueng maimouh dawk na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hatnavah Ammon miphunnaw a onae talai, Jabbok tuipui hoi talai, mon dawk e khopui hoi maimae Cathut ni na cakâ pouh e bang buet touh hai ka hnai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnavah kaimouh kamlang awh teh Bashan lam lah ka cei awh. Bashan siangpahrang Og hai a taminaw hoi Edrei vah kaimouh na tuk hanlah a tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni ahni hah taket awh hanh. Ama hoi a taminaw hai thoseh, a talai hai thoseh, nangmae kut dawk na poe awh han. Heshbon khopui dawk kaawm e Amor siangpahrang Sihon koe na sak e patetlah hete Siangpahrang koehai na sak han telah kai koe a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni Bashan Siangpahrang Og hoi a taminaw pueng hah maimae kut dawk na poe vaiteh, buet touh hai hlout laipalah, ka thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatnavah kaimouh ni khopui 60, Argob ram, Bashan ram, Og siangpahrang e uknaeram, khopui buet touh boehai hlung laipalah ka tuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hote khopuinaw teh, ka rasang poung e rapan, longkhanaw hoi kacakpounge khopui lah ao. Alouk lae kho moikapap hai ka la awh, ka tuk awh teh koung ka raphoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon koe ka sak awh e patetlah napui camo pueng koung ka thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saringnaw hoi kho thung e hnopainaw teh kamamouh hanlah ka la awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatnavah Arnon palangpui hoi kamtawng teh, Hermon mon totouh, Jordan palang namran lah kaawm e Amor siangpahrang roi e kut dawk e Arnon yawn koehoi Hermon mon totouh e ram hah kaimouh ni ka la pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hermon mon hah Sidonnaw ni Sirion telah thoseh, Amornaw ni Senir telah thoseh a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanghling dawk e khopuinaw puenghoi Gilead uknaeram pueng Og siangpahrang Og khopui, Edrei khopui totouh, Bashan ram puengpa ka la pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalenpounge miphun koehoi ka tho e Bashan siangpahrang Og ama duengdoeh ka hlout. Ayung dong 9, adangka dong 4 touh e sumikhun teh, Ammon ram Rabbah khopui vah ao nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah kaimouh ni la pouh e talai hah Arnon palang teng kaawm e Aroer khopui hoi kamtawng teh, Gilead mon a tangawn totouh khopuinaw hoi Reuben miphun hoi Gad miphunnaw ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilead mon a tangawn hoi Og siangpahrang ni a uknaeram kalenpounge hmuen telah kaw e Argob ram, Bashan ram pueng teh Manasseh miphunnaw atangawn ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh miphun Jair ni Argob ram pueng Geshur kho Maakath kho totouh a la pouh hnukkhu, Sahnin totouh amamae a min a ceisak e lahoi Havvoth- Jair ram telah a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gilead khopui teh Makhir miphunnaw ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben miphun, Gad miphunnaw teh, Gilead khopui hoi Arnon palangpui, alungui totouh Arnon ram khori Arabah palang pui totouh hai thoseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jordan palang teng Kinnereth hoi Sodom talî e kanîtholah kaawm e Arabah Pisgah khopui totouh e hai thoseh ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatnavah, kai ni, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni hete ram heh namamouh han roup na poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatnavah tarankahawi e pueng ni puengcang a kâmahrawk awh teh, na hmaunawngha Isarel miphunnaw e a hmalah a cei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cathut ni nangmouh karoumcalah na o sak awh van e patetlah hmaunawnghanaw ka poe hoeh roukrak thoseh, Jordan palang namran e nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e talai ahnimouh ni a la hoehnahlan totouh thoseh. Na yu na canaw, saringnaw ni hai kai ni na poe e khopuinaw dawk ao awh han. Nama koe saring moi ao e kai ni ka panue. Thaw ka cum torei kai ni na la poe e patetlah nangmouh pueng teh lengkaleng na coe han kamcu e talai koe lah bout na ban awh han telah nangmouh kai ni lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatnavah Joshua hai, na BAWIPA ni hete siangpahrang kahni touh dawk a sak e hno pueng hah nang ni khei na hmu toe. Hot patetlah BAWIPA ni na phanae kho ramnaw dawk a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmae Cathut ni nanfmouh koe lah kampangkhai dawkvah, ahnimanaw hah taket awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut koe ka kâhei e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Oe Bawipa Jehovah, na san kai koe lentoe e hai thoseh, thaonae kut hai thoseh, sak na kamtawng toe. Nang e thaonae na kamnue sak e patetlah kalvan hoi talai dawk bang patet e cathut ni maw a sak thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kai teh Jordan palang namran lah ka raka teh, kahawipoung e ram hoi Lebanon mon koehoi kamtawng teh kahawi e monnaw na hmawt sak haw telah ka kâhei nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cathut ni nangmouh kecu dawk kai koe a lungkhuek dawkvah, ka lawk hah na thai pouh hoeh. Cathut ni hai a khout toe. Hete hno hoi kâseng e lawk hah bout na dei pouh hanh lawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah mon som dawkvah luen nateh, kanîtho, kanîloum, atung, aka lah kangvawi nateh ram hah khenhaw! Jordan tui rakat hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joshua hah lawk thui nateh, thapoe nateh ka bawm haw. Ahni ni hete miphun hmalah a cei vaiteh, na hmu e ram hah râw lah na pang sak han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hottelah kaimouh teh Bethpeor namran lah kaawm e tanghling dawk ka o awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oe Isarelnaw nangmouh ni na hring awh teh, mintoenaw ni a bawk e BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram na coe thai awh nahan, na sak awh hane kai ni na cangkhai e phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kai ni kâ na poe e lawknaw dawk, bout na thap awh mahoeh. Na rayu awh mahoeh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut e kâpoelawknaw hah na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cathut ni Baalpeor kecu a sak e hah nangmouh ni na mit hoi na hmu awh toe. Baalpeor kângue pueng nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh thung hoi be a raphoe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut dawk kângue e pueng teh, sahnin ditouh na hring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cei awh vaiteh na coe hane ram dawk na sak awh hane kaie BAWIPA Cathut ni kâ na poe e patetlah,kai ni phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw na cangkhai awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hotnaw hah tarawi awh. Hottelah na sak pawiteh, phunglawk ka thai e tami pueng e hmalah nangmae lungangnae hoi panuenae a kamnue han. Ahnimouh ni hete miphunpui teh, lungangnae hoi panuenae hoi ka kawi e miphun katang doeh telah ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maimouh ni ratoum na pueng koe maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni na khet na yawt teh, na pahrennae coe e patetlah alouke cathut ni pahren e miphun apimouh kaawm boi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kai ni sahnin nangmouh koe ka ta e kâlawk patetlah, phunglawk hoi kalan lah lawkcengnae ka tawn e miphun kalen, apimouh kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmouh ni Horeb mon van na Cathut hmalah, na kangdue awh navah na mit hoi na hmu awh e naw hah pahnim payon avai. Na hringyung thung na pâkuem thai awh nahan, namamouh kâhruetcuet awh. Kâyawm lahoi tarawi awh. Hotnaw hah na catounnaw hai cangkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatnavah BAWIPA ni, taminaw kai koe kamkhueng sak haw. Ahnimouh ni talai van a hring na thung kai na taki thai awh nahan a catounnaw a cangkhai sak nahanelah ka lawk hah na thaisak han telah kai koe a dei e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmouh ni rek na tho awh teh mon khok koe na kamkhueng awh. Hatnavah, monsom hmai a kak teh kalvan lungui teh duktamang, tâmai hoi akawi teh duk a kamthim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni hmai thung hoi na pato, nangmouh ni a mei na hmawt laipalah lawk duengdoeh na thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na tarawi awh hane kâpoelawk 10 touh hah a dei teh, lungphen 2 touh dawk a thut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cei awh teh na coe awh hane ram dawk na sak awh hane nangmouh koe na cangkhai e phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw hai Cathut ni kai koe kâ na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Horeb vah Cathut ni, hmai thung hoi nangmouh koe lawk a dei navah bang e meilam hai na hmu awh hoeh dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh ni tami napui tongpa mei
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Talai van kaawm e saring mei, kalvan kamleng e tava mei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Talai dawk vonpui hoi kâva e saring mei, talai thung tui dawk e tanga mei, hoi kâvan e kutsak hah, nangmouh ni bout na kamlang sin awh teh, namamouh han na sak hoeh nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kalvan lah na khet teh, Kanî, Thapa, Âsinaw tie kalvan e hno pueng na hmu navah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni, kalvan rahim kaawm e tami pueng koe a poe e hote hnonaw hah, na bawk awh nahane alouke taminaw ni na pasawt thai awh hoeh nahanelah, namahoima kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangmouh teh sahnin e patetlah BAWIPA Cathut e râw ka coe e miphun lah na o sak nahan, nangmouh teh Izip ram sum thawngnae takhuen koehoi na tâcokhai awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hot dueng laipalah, nangmouh kecu dawk, kai koe Cathut a lungkhuek, Jordan tui namran lah rakat laipalah, na coe awh hane Cathut ni na poe e ram thung vah kâen hoeh nahanelah lawk a kam toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hete ram dawk ka due han toe. Jordan tui ka rakat mahoeh nangmouh ni na raka awh vaiteh hote kahawipoung e ram na coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh koe na ta pouh e lawkkam na pahnim awh teh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a cakâ e kutsak na sak awh hoeh nahan, namahoima kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut teh ka kang e hmai, dipma Cathut doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na mincanaw na sak awh teh, hote ram dawk moikasawlah na o awh hnukkhu, koung na rawk awh teh buetbuet touh e mei hoi kâlat lah kutsak na sak awh teh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut a lung hoe na khuek sak awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan tui na raka awh teh na coe awh hane ram thung vah, a ro hoehnahlan na kahma awh han. Moikasawlah kho na sak awh laipalah, khoeroe na kahmakata awh han telah nangmae kong dawk na ka panuek khai e lah sahnin kalvan hoi talai ka palaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cathut ni hai nangmouh teh Jentelnaw koe alouklouk lah na kâkapek sak vaiteh, hrek lah kaawm e Jentelnaw koe youn touh na cawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hote hmuen dawk, tami kut hoi sak e, hmawt thai hoeh, thai thai hoeh, cat thai hoeh, a hmui ka thai thai hoeh e thing cathut, talung cathutnaw hah nangmouh ni na bawk awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hateiteh, hote hmuen dawk nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hah bout tawng han na ngai awh toteh, lungthin abuemlahoi na tawng awh pawiteh na hmu awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangmouh ni hmalae tueng dawk, rucatnae na khang awh toteh, hete hnonaw puenghoi na kâhmo awh navah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut koe lah bout na ban awh teh, lawk na tarawi awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nangmae Cathut teh pahrennae ka tawn e lah ao dawkvah, nangmanaw na pahnawt awh mahoeh, na raphoe awh mahoeh, lawk a kam e pahnim mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cathut ni talai dawk tami sak kamtawng hoi nangmouh na o hoehnahlan kaloum tangcoung e atueng dawk e hnonaw pueng hah, kalvan apoutnae koehoi avanglah apoutnae koe totouh pacei awh. Hettelah e kalenpounge hno kaawm boi na ou. Het patetlah e hno kamthang thai boi awh na ou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cathut ni hmai thung hoi a dei e lawk nangmouh ni na thai awh e patetlah alouke miphun ni a thai teh hloutnae a coe awh boi na ou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni, Izip ram nangmae hmalah a sak e patetlah mitnout panuenae hoi, kângairu hnonaw a saknae, kâtuknae a phasaknae, thaonae kut dâwnae, taki ka tho e vision a sak e lahoi, alouke cathut ni a cei teh, miphun buet touh koehoi buet touh ama hanelah ouk a la boi ou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut lah a onae hai thoseh, BAWIPA hoeh laipalah teh alouke cathut a ohoehnae hai thoseh, nangmouh na panue sak hanelah, hotnaw hah nangmouh koe a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangmouh na cangkhai awh teh, kalvan hoi lawk na thaisak toe. Talai van vah kalenpounge hmai hai na hmu sak teh, hmai thung hoi lawk hah na thai awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nangmae mintoenaw ka pahren dawkvah, a catoun hah ka rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nangmouh hlak a tha a sai awh vaiteh, kapap poung e miphunnaw nangmae hmalah hoi ka pâlei teh, sahnin e boiboe lah, a ram dawk a phakhai vaiteh, râw coe sak hanelah, hnotithainae lahoi, Izip ram lahoi na hmalah a hrawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut teh lathueng lae kalvan hoi rahim lae talai van hai thoseh, Cathut lah ao teh, alouke cathut awm hoeh tie hah, sahnin panuek awh, na lung thung pâkuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangmouh hoi na catounnaw ni khosak ahawi nahan, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk, hringsaw nahan thoseh, sahnin kai ni lawk na thui awh e kâpoelawknaw hah, na tarawi awh han telah Mosi ni a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hatnavah, imri hah taran laipalah, ka thet payon e tami teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />a yawng vaiteh, a hring hlout nahanelah Jordan palang kanîtholah khopui 3 touh Mosi ni a ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hete khopuinaw e min teh, Reuben miphun onae kahrawng, Bezer khopui, Gad miphun onae, Gilead ram dawk Ramoth khopui, Manasseh miphun onae Bashan ram Golan khopuinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hete kâlawk teh Mosi ni Isarelnaw koe a poe e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Izip ram hoi a tâco awh hnukkhu, Heshbon khopui kaawm e, Amor siangpahrang Sihon e ram thung, Jordan tui kanîtholah, Bethpeor khopui dawk kaawm e tanghling dawk Mosi ni a dei e phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mosi hoi Isarelnaw teh Izip ram hoi a tâco awh hnukkhu hote siangpahrang hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bashan siangpahrang Og tie Jordan tui namran lah kanîtholah, kaawm e Amon siangpahrang 2 touh a thei teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahnimae ram hah Arnon tui teng kaawm e Aroer khopui, Hermon mon tie Zion mon totouh thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan tui kanîtho hoi, kâkuen e talîpui teng, Arabah Pisgah totouh a lawp awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosi ni Isarelnaw a pâkhueng teh, Isarelnaw thai awh haw, na kamtu awh e kâhruetcuet lahoi na hringkhai thai awh nahan, sahnin ka dei e phunglawk hah kahawicalah thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni Horeb mon dawk maimouh hoi, lawk a kam awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hote lawkkam hah Cathut ni maimae mintoenaw hoi dueng a sak e tho hoeh, sahnin kahring rah niteh, hi kaawm e maimouh puenghoi hai sak e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA ni mon dawkvah hmai thung hoi, minhmai kadangka lah a dei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatnavah nangmouh ni hmai na taki awh teh, mon dawk na luen ngam awh hoeh dawkvah, kai teh BAWIPA Cathut e lawk na poe e hah dei hanelah BAWIPA hoi nangmae rahak ka kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dei e lawk hateh, nangmouh san lah na onae Izip ram hoi na ka tâcawtkhai e nangmae BAWIPA Cathut doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai hloilah Cathut alouke na bawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kalvan hai thoseh, talai dawk hai thoseh, talai thung tui thung hai thoseh, kaawm e hoi kâvan e meikaphawk banghai namamouh han lah na sak awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmalah tabo laihoi bawk hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmae Cathut, Kai teh dipmasin Cathut, kai na kamaithoenaw e catoun, se thum se pali totouh a napanaw e yon hah a canaw dawk ka pathung e Cathut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai hah lungpataw niteh, kaie kâpoelawk ka tarawi e a catounnaw koe a thongsang totouh pahrennae kamnuek sak e Cathut lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut e min hah laithoe koe lah na deirumram mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a min laithoe lah dei e yon a tawn telah BAWIPA ni a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk na thui e patetlah Sabbath hnin thoungsak hanelah ya awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnin taruk touh thung thaw na tawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnin sari hnin teh BAWIPA Cathut e Sabbath hnin doeh, hote hnin dawk nama hoi na canaw, san napui, san tongpa, maito, la, na saring pueng, na imyin hai thaw tawk mahoeh. Longkha thung duem na o e patetlah san napui san tongpanaw ni duem ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang teh Izip ram san lah na onae thoseh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni a thaonae kut a dâw teh, hote ram hoi nang na tâcokhai e pouk haw. Hote a kong dawk nang ni Sabbath hnin na ya han telah BAWIPA Cathut ni a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawkvah, na hring a saw teh na yawhawi nahanelah, BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk na thui e patetlah na manu hoi na pa barilawa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami thet hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uicuk hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ayâ e hno parawt hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na Imri koe, kahmanhoeh e kapanuekkhaikung lah awm hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na imri e a yu lungraduek hanh. Na imri e im, law, a san napui, a san tongpa, la, maito, hoi hnopai pueng buet touh boehai noenae lungthin tawn hanh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hete lawknaw heh mon dawk hoi, hmai tâmai duk kamthim e kahmot e a thung hoi BAWIPA ni puenghoi kacaipounge lawk hoi nangmouh kamkhueng e rangpuinaw koe a dei. Rek bout dei hoeh toe. Hote lawknaw haiyah lungphen kahni touh dawk a thut teh kai koe na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmouh ni hmo na thung e lawk na thai awh teh, Monsom hmai a kak lahun nah, nangmae catounnaw dawk e khobawinaw hoi kacuenaw kai koe a tho awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni a bawilennae hoi a lentoenae maimouh koe a kamnue sak toe. Hmai thung hoi lawk hah maimouh ni thai awh toe. Cathut teh tami hoi a kâhmo teh a kâpato eiteh, tami teh a hring rah tie panue awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Maimouh teh bangkongmaw atu due awh han vaw. Hete taki ka tho poung hmai ni maimouh teh na kak awh han toe. Maimae BAWIPA Cathut e lawk dei e hah bout thai awh pawiteh, due awh han doeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hring Cathut ni hmai thung hoi a dei e lawk hah, maimouh ni thai awh e patetlah, apipatet e tami ni maw ka thai ni teh ka hring vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang ni a tengpam cet nateh maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni a dei e pueng thai awh haw. Maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni kai koe na dei pouh e pueng patuen dei pouh haw. Kaimouh ni ka thai awh vaiteh ka tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hottelah nangmouh ni kai koe na dei awh e lawk BAWIPA ni a thai. BAWIPA Cathut nihai, hete miphun ni nang koe a dei e lawk ka thai, a dei e lawk pueng teh ahawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahnimouh hoi a catounnaw ni ahawinae a hmu nahanelah, kai na taki awh teh kâpoelawknaw pueng hah pou a tarawi ngainae lungthin hoi kawi awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rimnaw koe lah bout ban a leih telah dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang teh hete hmuen dawk ka teng kangdout. Ahnimouh kai ni ka coe sak e ram dawk a sak awh hane ahnimouh cangkhai hane kâpoelawk, phunglawk hoi lawkcengnae pueng ka dei han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatdawkvah maimae BAWIPA Cathut ni kâ na poe e patetlah nangmouh ni na sak awh nahan, na kâhruetcuet awh han. Avoilah nakunghai, aranglah nakunghai na phen takhai awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nangmouh na coe awh hane ram dawk, nangmouh ni duethinae dawk hoi na hlout awh vaiteh, hringyung saw nahanelah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a dei e lamthungnaw pueng dawk na dawn awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh hoi na mincanaw ni namamae BAWIPA Cathut hah na taki awh vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kai ni na poe e naw, pueng hah hringyung thung na tarawi thai e hoi, na hringyung a vang sak thai nahan na cei awh vaiteh, na coe hane ram dawk, na sak awh hane kai ni na cangkhai hanlah, nangmae Cathut ni lawk na poe e kâpoelawknaw, phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw hateh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oe Isarel miphun, mintoenaw e Cathut e lawkkam patetlah nang ni sanu tui, khoitui a lawngnae ram dawk na yawhawi awh teh, na pungdaw awh nahan thai awh, kâhruetcuet lahoi tarawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Oe Isarel miphun thai awh haw, maimae BAWIPA Cathut teh buet touh dueng e BAWIPA la doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut hah, na lungthin abuemlah, na hringnae abuemlah hoi thaonae abuemlahoi lungpataw haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni na poe e lawk hah na lung dawk na pâkuem han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote lawk hah panki lahoi na canaw na cangkhai han. Im dawk tahung nahai thoseh, cei nahai thoseh, i nahai thoseh, thaw nahai thoseh, hote lawk hah na dei pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote lawk hai na kut dawk mitnout nahanelah thoseh, na mit rahak hai thoseh na bet han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Im takhang, khopui longkha dawk hai na thut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kangdue sak hoeh e khopuinaw hai thoseh, hnokahawi hoi kakawi e imnaw hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuikhu na tai hoeh e hai thoseh, na patue hoeh e misur takha hoi olivekungnaw hai thoseh, nang na poe hanelah na pa Abraham, Isak, Jakop, koe lawkkam e ram koe nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na hrawi awh vaiteh kaboumcalah na ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />San lah na onae Izip ram lahoi nangmouh na ka tâcawtkhai e BAWIPA Cathut na pahnim awh hoeh nahan, namamouh kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut hah na taki awh han. Hote Cathut dueng na bawk awh han. A min lahoi thoe hai na kâbo awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alouke Cathut, na tengpam e miphunnaw e cathut hnuk na kâbang awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmae Cathut teh nangmouh dawk dipma Cathut doeh. Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut teh nangmouh koe a lungkhuek vaiteh, talai van hoi na raphoe han tie taki hane ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh ni Massah hmuen dawk na tanouk e patetlah na BAWIPA Cathut hah tanouk awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni na hruek pouh awh e kapanuekkhaikung, lawkkam, kâpoelawknaw hah panki lahoi na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang na hlout nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut e a lawkkam patetlah tarannaw pueng, nangmae hmalah hoi ka pâlei vaiteh, nangmae na mintoenaw koe ka kam e ram hah na coe awh vaiteh, na o sak nahan, BAWIPA Cathut hmalah kalan e hno sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmalae tueng dawk na canaw ni, kaimae Cathut ni na poe e lawkpanuesaknae, phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw hah bangmaw a deingai telah na pacei awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang ni kaimanaw Izip ram dawk Faro siangpahrang e san lah ka o awh nah BAWIPA e a thaonae kut hoi kaimanaw hah Izip ram hoi na tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />BAWIPA nihai, lentoe kângairunae hah Izip ram hoi Faro imthungkhu lathueng hai thoseh, maimae hmaitung a sak hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mintoenaw koe a kam e ram dawk na kâenkhai teh hmuen na poe hanelah hote ram dawk hoi na tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />BAWIPA ni sahnin totouh na lungma e patetlah hringnae na hlung pouh nahanelah, maimouh hawi nahanlah hete phunglawknaw pueng tarawi han. BAWIPA Cathut taki hanelah lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, maimae BAWIPA ni kâ na poe e patetlah, hete kâpoelawknaw pueng a hmalah tarawi nahanelah, na kâhruetcuet pawiteh, lannae koe na pha awh han telah, bout na dei awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni na coe awh hane ram dawk na kâenkhai awh vaiteh, Hit, Girgashite tami, Amor tami, Kanaan tami, Parizzite tami, Hiv tami, Jubusitnaw nangmouh hlak kalen ka rasang e miphun 7 touh hah a pâlei teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangmae kut dawk bout na poe awh navah, na thei awh vaiteh capingkacailah na raphoe awh han, ahnimouh hoi lawkkamnae na sak awh mahoeh, na lungma awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimouh hoi yuvâ lah na awm awh mahoeh, na canu hoi na capa, a capa hoi na canu na kâyuva sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh ni na ca hah kai koe thokhai laipalah, alouke cathut bawk hanelah a pasawt awh han. Hatnavah BAWIPA lungkhueknae hoi nangmouh tang na raphoe avai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh dawk bangtelamaw ka sak han, ahnimae thuengnae pueng ka raphoe han, kutsak pueng ka raphoe han. Asherahkungnaw ka tâtueng han. Thuk e meeikaphawk pueng hmai ka pau pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge miphun doeh. Talai van kaawm e miphun hlak nange BAWIPA Cathut ni coe kamcu e miphun lah o sak nahan nang teh na rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang teh alouke miphun hlak hoe na pap dawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut ni na lungpatawnae dawk na rawi e tho hoeh, nang teh Jentelnaw hlak hoe na youn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni nang na lungma dawk thoseh, na mintoenaw koe lawkkam ka raphoe han ka ngai hoeh dawk thoseh, san lah na onae Izip ram ka uk e Faro siangpahrang kut dawk hoi thaonae kut hoi nangmouh na tâcokhai awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut teh Cathut katang, yuemkamcu e Cathut, Bawipa ka lungpataw ni teh phunglawk katarawinaw e se a thongsang totouh lawkkam acak teh pahrennae kamnuek e Cathut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA kamaithoenaw raphoe hanelah, amamouh hmalah yon pathung e Cathut tie hah panuek awh. BAWIPA kamaithoenaw minhmai khen laipalah, amamae hmaitung yon moi a pathung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, sahnin na poe e phunglawknaw hoi kâpoelawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw hah na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote lawkcengnaenaw nang ni na tarawi hanelah, lawk na ngâi pawiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na mintoenaw hanlah lawk a kam e lawkkam hoi lungmanae hah nangmae lathueng a kangning sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahni ni nang hah na lungpataw vaiteh, yawhawinae na poe han, na pungdaw sak han. Na poe hane na mintoenaw koe lawkkam e ram dawk, na khe e na canaw hai thoseh, nange talai, a pawhik, cang, misurtui, satui, maito a pungdaw, tuhunaw hai thoseh yawhawi ka poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang teh miphun pueng hlak yawhawinae hoe ka coe e lah na o vaiteh, nang dawk ka ting e tongpa napui buet touh hai awm mahoeh. Saringnaw dawk ka ting e tongpa napui buet touh hai awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cathut nihai, patawpanat pueng nang koehoi ka takhoe vaiteh, na panue e Izip ram e pataw kathoutnaw nang dawk ka phat sak mahoeh. Nang ka maithoe e naw koe ka pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni nang dawk na poe e miphun pueng a raphoe han. Na mit ni ahnimanaw na pahren mahoeh. Ahnimae cathut na bawk mahoeh. Na bawk pawiteh, na kamthui na rawp nahanelah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lung thung hoi hete miphunnaw heh maimouh hlak hoe apaphnawn, bangtelamaw pâlei thai awh han na tet awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahnimouh taket hanh, BAWIPA Cathut ni Faro hoi Izip tami pueng koe a sak e hah pahnim hanh awh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tanouknae kalenpoung na mit hoi na hmu e naw hai thoseh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na tâcokhai navah na patue e mitnoutnaw hai thoseh, thaonae kut a dâw e hai thoseh, kheikhei na pouk awh han. Hot patetvanlah, nang ni na taki e miphunnaw koe nange BAWIPA Cathut ni a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hothloilah, ka cawi rah niteh, kâhrawknaw a due hoehroukrak nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni, khoingannaw ahnimouh koe a patoun han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimouh kecu dawk na lungpuen awh hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, takikathopounge nangmae BAWIPA Cathut teh nangmouh koe ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni hote miphunnaw teh paiyai lahoi nangmouh koehoi na pâlei pouh han. Kahrawng e sarangnaw nangmouh koe lah pung langvaih tie puen han ao teh, ahnimouh tang pâlei kawi nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut ni ahnimouh nangmouh koe na poe vaiteh, koung a rawk totouh kalenpounge rawknae ka pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahnimae Siangpahrangnaw hai nangmae kut dawk na poe vaiteh, ahnimae min taluenae kalvan rahim vah raphoe han. Ahnimouh ka raphoe hoehroukrak nangmae hmalah apihai kang dout thai e awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sak e meikaphawknaw pueng hmai pau pouh han. Kutsak dawk kaawm e sui ngun na noe mahoeh, na lat mahoeh, na lat pawiteh yon lah ao hane ngaihri kawi ao. Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a panuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Panuet kawi na im dawk thokhai hanh, na thokhai pawiteh, nang teh hot patetlah thoebo han kawi lah doeh na o tie taki ao. Hot patet e hno hah nang ni khoeroe na panuet han, thoebo kawi e hno doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang teh na hring vaiteh na pungdaw nahan BAWIPA Cathut ni na mintoenaw koe kam pouh e ram dawk na cei vaiteh, na coe nahanelah, sahnin kai ni lawk na poe e kâpoelawk pueng na tarawi nahanlah na kâhruetcuet han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni kâpoelawk tarawi ngainae lung na tawn hoi tawn hoeh e na tanouk awh teh, ka loum tangcoung kum 40 touh thung kahrawngum vah na hrawinae naw hah na pahnim awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah na lungthin rahnoum awh teh, kahaikahlam lah na o sak navah, na panue e nahoeh, na mintoenaw ni panue boihoeh e manna hoi na kawk awh teh, tami teh vaiyei hoi dueng hring hoeh, BAWIPA e lawk lahoi doeh hring tie a panue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum 40 touh thung hnicu hai pawn hoeh na khok hai phing hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A na pa ni a ca a toun e patetlah na BAWIPA Cathut ni na toun tie na lung hoi na pouk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a lamthung na dawn teh BAWIPA taki lahoi kâpoelawknaw na tarawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni kahawi e ram, tanghling, mon dawk hoi ka phuek e tuipui, sokca, tuihnu, tuiim hoi ka kawi e ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />catun, barli, misurkung, thaibunglungkungnaw, talekung, hoi ka kawi e ram, olive satui, khoitui hoi ka kawi e ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />voutnae awm laipalah, ka boum lah canae ram, sumtalung hoi a kawi teh, mon dawk hoi rahum tainae ram koe nangmouh hah na hrawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kahawi poung e ram na poe awh dawkvah, kaboumcalah na ca awh toteh, na BAWIPA Cathut e a lungmanae na pholen awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni na poe e kâpoelawknaw, phunglawknaw, hoi lawkcengnaenaw tarawihoehnae lahoi Cathut na pahnim awh hoeh nahanlah sahnin kai ni kâ na poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka boum lah na ca teh im kahawi dawk na o navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nangmae tu, maito, sui, ngun hoi hnopai naw apung toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na kâoup teh, yampa vah santoungnae Izip ram hoi na ka tâcawtkhai e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hmai tahrun, aikamnaw apap teh, tui kahran ti ohoehnae hmuen, takikathopounge kahrawngum dawk na ka hrawi niteh, hmai talung thung hoi tui ka tâcawt sak e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nang hah na tanouk teh, a hnukteng na pahren nahanelah, na mintoenaw ni panue boihoeh e mana hoi kahrawngum na kakawkkung nange BAWIPA Cathut hah na pahnim awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Bahu, ka thaonae kut hoi hete hno kai ni ka tawn toe telah na lungthung hoi na pouk hoeh nahan kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut duengdoeh na pouk han, Bangkongtetpawiteh, na mintoenaw kam pouh e lawkkam hah, sahnin e patetlah caksak nahanelah, hnopai hmuthainae na kapoekung teh Cathut doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut na pahnim awh teh, alouke cathutnaw na hnai awh teh na bawk awh pawiteh, rawknae dawk na pha katang awh han. Sahnin kai teh nangmouh koe kapanuekkhaikung lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah na ngâi awh hoeh dawkvah Jentelnaw nangmae na hmalah ka raphoe e patetlah nangmouh hai na raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oe Isarelnaw thai awh haw. Nangmouh hlak a thakasai e miphun hai thoseh, kalvan kadeng e rapan hoi ka kawi e khopuinaw hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anakim miphun hmalah bangtelah vai kangdue thai tie lawk na thai teh, na panue e Anakim miphun tie kalenpounge miphun hai thoseh, tuk nateh lawp hanelah atu Jordan tui raka tawmlei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na hmalah a cei teh, ka kang e hmai patetlah ao teh, ahnimouh a raphoe vaiteh, na hmaitung vah, a tabo han tie hah na lungkuep awh. Cathut ni a dei e patetlah nang ni ahnimouh na pâlei awh vaiteh karang poung lah na raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA na Cathut ni ahnimouh nang koehoi a pâlei hnukkhu, nang ni kaie lannae dawk doeh BAWIPA ni hete ram ka kut dawk na poe telah na pouk payon vaih. Hote miphunnaw hawihoeh e dawk BAWIPA ni ka hmaitung hoi a pâlei telah pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na sak awh e hnokahawi dawk hai thoseh, lannae dawk hoi hai thoseh, hote ram a coe awh hane nahoeh. Hete miphunnaw hawihoeh dawk hoi thoseh, BAWIPA ni na pa Abraham, Isak, Jakop koe lawkkam e lawk hah, a caksak nahan na Cathut ni ahnimouh na hmalah hoi a pâlei e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na BAWIPA ni nama e na hawinae dawk hoi, kahawipoung e ram na poe e nahoeh, nang teh na lahuen ka cak e miphun doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ni kahrawngum vah BAWIPA lung na khuek sak e hah, pahnim hanh. Izip ram hoi na tâco pasuek nah, hete hmuen koe na pha a totouh, BAWIPA koe taran lah na thaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb vah BAWIPA a lung na khuek sak awh teh, nangmouh raphoe hane totouh, BAWIPA hah a lungkhuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BAWIPA hoi lawkkamnae thutnae talung, lungphen la hanelah, mon lah ka luen navah, hnin 40 touh thung vaiyei hoi tui ka catnet laipalah, mon vah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni lungphen kahni touh Cathut e kut hoi thut e na poe. Na kamkhueng hnin vah, mon som hmai dawk hoi a dei e lawknaw ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnin 40 arum 40 akuep navah hote lawkkam lungphen kahni touh e teh, BAWIPA Cathut ni kai koe na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA ni Thaw nateh karang cathuk leih. Izip ram hoi na tâcokhai e taminaw a rawk awh toe, tarawi hane ka poe e lamthung a phen awh toe. Kutsak meikapawk doeh a bawk awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />BAWIPA ni, hete miphunnaw ka khet nah, a lahuen mangkhak e miphunnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka madueng na awm sak awh. Ahnimouh kai ni ka raphoe han. A min hai kalvan rahim vah ka raphoe han. Nang teh ahnimouh hlak tha na sai sak vaiteh, miphun ka pungdaw sak han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah lawkkam talung kahni touh ka sin teh, ka kamlang teh hmai ka kang e mon dawk hoi ka kum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh ni, BAWIPA Cathut koe na yon awh teh, maito meikaphawk hlun awh teh, Cathut ni lawk na poe e lamthung karang poung lah, na phen awh toe tie ka hmu navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kut roi hoi ka patuep e lungphen, kahni touh e hah nangmae hmaitung vah ka raphei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmouh ni, BAWIPA lung na khuek sak nahanelah, a hmalah yonnae na sak awh e yon pueng dawkvah, yampa e patetlah BAWIPA hmalah ka tabo teh, hnin 40 rum 40 touh vaiyei hoi tui catnet laipalah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni nangmouh na raphoe hanlah, puenghoi lungkhueknae a tâco sak e kai ni ka taki. Hatnavah BAWIPA ni kaie ka lawk bout na thai pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Aron raphoe hanelah a lung puenghoi a khuek dawkvah, Aron hane lahai ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yonnae tie na sak awh e maitoca hah ka la teh, a tui lah kalawng sak. A kanuikapin lah rekrek ka kanawi teh, mon dawk hoi ka lawng e palang dawk ka tâkhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Taberah, Messah hmuen, Kiborthhattaavah hmuen koe hai, nangmouh ni BAWIPA hah a lungkhuek nahanlah na sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kadeshbarnea hoi BAWIPA ni cet awh nateh, kai ni na poe e ram hah lat awh. Nangmouh na patoun awh navah, nangmouh ni nangmae BAWIPA e kâ poe e na kangek awh. BAWIPA na yuem awh hoeh, lawk hai ngâi laipalah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka panue hnin hoi nangmouh teh BAWIPA hah na taran awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nangmouh na raphoe han telah a dei dawkvah, kai teh yampa e patetlah hnin 40 rum 40 touh ka tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />BAWIPA koe, Oe Bawipa Jehovah, lentoenae hoi na ratang teh, thaonae kut hoi Izip hoi na tâcokhai e, nange râw lah kaawm e hete taminaw hah raphoe hanh loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nange san Abraham, Isak, Jakop hah pahnim hanh. Hete miphunnaw teh a lungpatanae, a yonnae hoi a hawihoehnae pâkuem pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hottelah hoeh pawiteh, tâconae ram dawk e taminaw ni, Cathut ni a kam pouh e ram dawk, a thokhai thai hoeh dawkvah, a hmu ngaihoeh dawk na ou, kahrawngum thei hanelah a ngai dawk na ou ati han nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hetnaw teh lentoenae hoi, na kut na dâw teh, na tâcokhai e nange râwnaw doeh telah kai ni ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat navah, Cathut ni ahmaloe e talung kahni touh e patetlah talung kahni touh bout bo e, kai ka onae koe takhang loe, thingkong hai sak loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na raphei e hmaloe e talung dawk thut e lawk patetlah apâhni e talung dawk bout ka thut han rak, hote talung teh thingkong thung na hruek han ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai ni Anri thing e thingkong ka sak teh ahmaloe e talung patetlah talung kahni touh ka bo teh, hote talung ka sin teh mon lah ka luen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kamkhueng awh hnin vah, BAWIPA ni mon vah hmai thung hoi a dei e kâpoelawk 10 touh hah, ahmaloe e ca thut e patetlah BAWIPA ni a thut teh kai hah na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kamlang teh mon hoi ka kum. Ka sak tangcoung e thingkong thung hote lungphen ka hruet teh, BAWIPA ni dei e patetlah hote thingkong thung vah atu ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mon dawkvah yampa ka onae tueng patetlah hnin 40 rum 40 touh bout ka o teh, hat nahai BAWIPA ni nangmouh raphoe hoeh nahan kaie ka lawk hah a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA ni, thaw haw, hete miphunnaw koe poe hanelah, na mintoenaw koe lawkkamnae ram koe lah a cei awh vaiteh, a lawp awh nahan ahnimae hmalah cet telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isarelnaw teh Moserah hmuen koehoi a cei awh teh, Bennejaakan hmuen dawk a roe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi a kamthaw awh teh, Horakeikat hmuen koe a roe awh. Hote hmuen koehoi bout a kamthaw awh teh, sawkca tui apapnae koe Jotbathah hmuen koe a roe awh. Haw hoi bout a cei awh teh, Eziongeber hmuen koe a roe awh. Hote hmuen koehoi a cei awh teh, Zinahtokadesh hmuen koe a roe awh. Hote hmuen koehoi bout a cei awh teh, Moserah mon dawk a roe awh. Hote hmuen koe Aron a due teh a pakawp awh. A capa Eleazar ni a na pa yueng lah a tawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levih miphunnaw teh Cathut lawkkam thingkong a hrawm sak hanelah thoseh, a hmalah kangdue vaiteh a thaw tawk sak hanelah thoseh, a kâtawnnae hoi yawhawinae poe sak hanlah thoseh, sahnin totouh ahnimae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Levih miphunnaw teh a hmaunawnghanaw hoi ham reirei coe awh mahoeh. Râw hah coe awh mahoeh. Na BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk na kam pouh e patetlah BAWIPA teh a coe awh hane râw la doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Oe Isarel, BAWIPA na Cathut taket haw, a lamthung dawnnae, na BAWIPA Cathut hah na lungthin abuemlahoi, na hringnae abuem lahoi lungpataw nateh a thaw tawknae,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na hawi nahanlah sahnin ka dei e BAWIPA e phunglawk tarawinae hoeh laipalah teh na BAWIPA ni bang thaw mouh a hei va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kalvan hoi kalvannaw hai thoseh, talai hoi talai hno pueng hai thoseh, na BAWIPA ni a tawn e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah, na BAWIPA ni na mintoenaw hah a lungpataw teh, sahnin e patetlah ahnimouh miphun lah kaawm e nang hah alouke miphunnaw hlak na rawi e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na lungthin vuensoma haw. Na lung bout patak sak hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na Cathut teh cathutnaw e Cathut, bawipanaw e BAWIPA, kalenpounge Cathut, a thakaawmpounge, taki ka tho e, tami minhmai khen hoeh, tadawnghno hai cat hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lahmainu hoi naranaw lawk a ceng teh, imyin a lungpataw teh ca hane hoi khohna hane ka poe e BAWIPA doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, imyinnaw hah lungpataw awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh Izip ram lah Imyin lah ouk na o boi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA hah na taki awh vaiteh, a thaw na tawk awh han. BAWIPA koe na kâhnai awh han, a min lahoi lawkkamnae sak awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />BAWIPA teh na lentoenae na Cathut doeh. Nang ni na mit hoi na hmu e patetlah takikathopounge naw hah ka sak e lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mintoenaw teh, Izip ram lah a ceicathuk awh navah, tami 70 duengdoeh ka phat, atuteh kalvan Âsi patetlah Cathut ni apap sak toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nang teh na BAWIPA na Cathut lungpataw han, kâ na poe e phunglawk, lawkcengnae hoi kâpoelawknaw hah pou na tarawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA ni na toun awh e hai thoseh, a lentoenae thoseh, a thaonae kut a dâw e thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mitnoutnae thoseh, Izip ram dawk, Izip siangpahrang, Faro siangpahrang hoi khocanaw koe a sak e hno hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izip ransanaw lah kaawm e a marang, rangleng lathueng hno a sak e thoseh, nangmouh na ka pâlei e naw hah tuipui paling a ramuk sak teh, sahnin totouh a thei e hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hete a hmuen koe na pha totouh, kahrawng vah na kâhei awh navah nangmouh han a sak e hno hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben miphun Eliab capa Dathan hoi Abiram ti koe ka sak e hno hai thoseh, talai ni a ang teh a imthungkhu abuemlah, a rimnaw, a tawnta e hnopainaw hoi Isarelnaw e rahak vah, a payon e thoseh, kahmawt awh hoeh e na canaw koe kai ni ka dei hoeh, hotteh namamouh ni panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a sak e hno kalenpoungnaw pueng hah namamouh roeroe ni na hmu awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nangmouh ni na cei awh vaiteh, na coe a hane ram sanutui hoi khoitui a lawngnae ram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mintoe hoi catounnaw koe poe hane BAWIPA ni lawk a kam e ramnaw dawk, moikasawlah kho na sak a thai nahan, a tu kâ na poe e kâ lawknaw pueng na tarawi a han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cei awh teh na coe a hane ram laikawk patetlah cati ka hei teh khok hoi tui awi e ram nangmouh na tâconae Izip ram hoi kâ van hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cei awh teh na coe awh hane ram teh monnaw, tanghlingnaw hoi a kawi vaiteh, kho ratui hah ka net e ram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA cathut ni a khetyawt e kum touh thung a khetyawt e ram doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hah na lungthin abuemlahoi, na hringnae abuem lahoi lungpataw awh. A thaw na tawk awh nahanelah, sahnin kai ni kâ na poe e naw kâpoelawknaw hah na tarawi awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nangmouh teh cakang, misurtui, satuinaw hah na pâkhueng sak nahanelah, ratui kho, a hnukteng e kho hah nangmae ram ka rak sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaboumcalah na ca nahan, na saringnaw han remke dawk hram kanaw e ka sai sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh teh kahawihoehe koe lah na lungthin na kamlang awh vaiteh, Cathut alouknaw na bawk awh hoeh nahan namamouh kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh BAWIPA a lungkhuek vaiteh, khorak laipalah talai dawk a pawhik tâcawt laipalah, kalvan hah a khan han. BAWIPA ni na poe e kahawipoung e ram dawk karangpoung lah na kahmakata awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kai ni ka dei e lawk hah na lung dawk pâkuem nateh, nout nahan na kut dawk nout hanelah na kawm awh vaiteh, na mit rahak e rui patetlah na kawm awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote lawk hah nangmouh ni im dawk na tahung nah thoseh, lam na cei nahai thoseh, na i na thaw nahai thoseh na dei awh vaiteh, na canaw hai na cangkhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Im takhang dawk hai thoseh, longkha dawk hai thoseh na thut awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah na sak awh pawiteh, na mintoenaw ka poe hanelah lawk ka kam e ram dawk nangmae hringnae, na canaw hringnae, kalvan hring sawnae patetlah talai van a hring a saw awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmouh teh namamae BAWIPA Cathut hah lungpatawnae hoi a lamthung dawk na dawn awh vaiteh, BAWIPA dawk na kâhnai thai nahan kai ni lawk na poe e hete kâpoelawk pueng hah tawksak hanlah kâhruetcuet lahoi na tarawi awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />BAWIPA ni miphunnaw pueng hah nangmae hmalah hoi be pâlei vaiteh, nangmouh hlak athakaawme kapappoung e miphunnaw hah na uk awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na khok hoi na coungroe e pueng namamouh hanlah na la awh vaiteh, kahrawng hoi kamtawng vaiteh, Lebanon mon totouh Euphrates tuipui hoi kamtawng teh, talîpui totouh thoseh, pou kâbet e talai hah nangmae ram lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangmae hmalah apihai kangdout thai mahoeh. Nangmouh ni na coungroe e hmuen dawk kaawm e naw teh, nangmanaw hah na taki awh vaiteh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni, lawk a kam e patetlah a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khenhaw! Sahnin vah nangmae hmalah yawhawinae hoi thoebonae ka hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sahnin ka dei e nangmae BAWIPA Cathut e kâpoelawknaw hah na tarawi awh pawiteh, Yawhawi poenae,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />nangmae BAWIPA Cathut e kâpoelawknaw na tarawi laipalah, sahnin lawk na thui e lamthung dawk hoi na phen awh teh, na panue boihoeh e alouke cathut hah na bawk awh pawiteh, thoebo lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na cei awh teh, na coe awh hane ram BAWIPA Cathut ni na kâenkhai awh toteh, yawhawinae teh Gerizim mon dawk na hruek awh vaiteh, thoebonae teh Ebal vah na hruek awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hote monnaw teh, Jordan tuipui kanîloumlah, Kanaannaw a onae Moreh kathenkungnaw, Gilgal khopui, hoi kâkuen e na ram dawk ao awh nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe awh e ram hah na coe awh hanlah, Jordan tuipui namran lah na raka awh vaiteh, hote ram hah na coe awh vaiteh, na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sahnin nangmae hmalah ka hruek e phunglawk hoi lawkcengnae pueng na hringkhai awh han han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh ni talai dawk na hring nathung na coe awh nahanelah, na mintoenaw ni a bawk awh e BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk na tarawi awh hane phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnae hateh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangmouh ni na uk awh e miphunnaw ni, bawknae monnaw, monruinaw dawk e thingkungnaw rahim kaawm e cathutnaw hai thoseh, bawknae hmuen puenghai thoseh koung na raphoe pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimae thuengnae khoungroenaw hai na raphoe pouh han. Meikaphawknaw hai na raphoe pouh han. Asherimnaw hai hmai hoi na sawi pouh han. Ahnimae cathut kutsaknaw hah na tâtueng awh han. Hote hmuen dawk hote cathut min na raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hot patet lae hnonaw hno lahoi BAWIPA Cathut na bawk awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hateiteh, BAWIPA Cathut ni na miphun thung hoi a min ao nahanelah, a rawi e hmuen hah na tawng awh vaiteh hote hmuen koe na cei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe nangmouh ni hmaisawi thuengnae naw hoi pung hra pung touh thueng e hno, kahek e hno lawkkamnae hoi kâkuen e thueng e hno, mahmawk sak e thueng e hno hoi maito, hmaloe ka khe e tunaw hah na thokhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hmalah na ca awh han. Na sak nah tangkuem dawk nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe dawkvah, nangmouh teh, nama hoi na imthungnaw, na kut hoi na tawk e naw pueng dawkvah na lunghawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu e tueng, hete hmuen koe na sak e patetlah hote hmuen koe tami pueng ma pouknae rumram hoi na sak awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh teh, kâhatnae ram dawk thoseh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni râw lah na poe e ram dawk thoseh, na kâen awh hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmouh teh Jordan palang na raka awh toteh, na coe awh hane nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni râw lah na poe e ram dawk na o awh vaiteh, tarannaw e kut dawk hoi nangmouh na rungngang teh karoumcalah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A min ao nahanelah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen haw vah ao han. Hote hmuen koe kai ni lawk na thui e patetlah nangmae hmaisawi thuengnae, satheinaw, pung hra pung touh, na kut hoi na sak e hnonaw, BAWIPA koe lawk na kam e patetlah lawkkam e naw pueng hah na thokhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namamouh hoi nangmae capanaw, canunaw, sanpanaw, sannunaw, râw pang hane ao hoeh dawkvah, nangmae longkha thung kaawm e Levihnaw hoi cungtalah nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hmalah na lunghawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmouh teh, na hmu awh e hmuen pueng dawk hmaisawi thuengnae na sak awh hoeh nahanelah, na kâhruetcuet awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei, nange miphun thung dawk hoi phun touh koe kaawm e BAWIPA ni a rawi e hmuen dawkvah hmaisawi thuengnae hah na sak han. Hote hmuen koevah, kai ni lawk na thui e naw pueng hah na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah, BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe e patetlah na onae kho tangkuem kaawm e na ca ngai e pueng na thei vaiteh longkha ca thainae kâ na tawn awh. Kathounge hoi kathounghoehe ni hai sayuk sakhi patetlah hote moi hah a ca thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatnavah, a thi na cat awh mahoeh. Tui rabawk e patetlah talai dawk na rabawk awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kho thung kaawm e nange cakang, nange misurtui, nange satui, nange maito, nange tu camin, lawk na kam e nange lawkkam abuemlah, na mahmawk na poe hno, na kut hoi na sak e hno pung hra pung touh hah na cat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatei, nama hoi cungtalah, nange capa, nange canu, nange sanpa, nange sannu, nange longkha thung kaawm e Levihnaw ni nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ma ni a rawi e hmuen koe nangmae BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah na ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ram thung na o awh roukrak, Levih miphunnaw na pahnim awh hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni nang hanelah lawkkam e patetlah na ram ramri a kaw sak toteh, nang ni moi ka cat haw nei telah na ti vaiteh, na lungthin ni moi ca hane a ngai dawkvah, nang ni na lungngai e patetlah moi na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a min ao nahanelah na rawi pouh e hmuen teh, nang hoi hlatpoung pawiteh, nang koe ka dei e patetlah BAWIPA ni na poe e maito hoi tu hah na thei vaiteh, na longkha thungvah na lungngai patetlah na ca thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sayuk sakhi moi na ca e patetlah hote moi hah na ca thai. Kathounge hoi kathounghoehe ni hai hote moi hah reirei a ca thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thi na ca awh hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet sak awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, thi teh hringnae doeh. Hringnae hoi a moi reirei na cat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na cat awh roeroe mahoeh. Tui rabawk e patetlah talai dawk na rabawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang teh BAWIPA e hmalah kalan e hno hah na sak dawkvah, nang hoi cungtalah, na catounnaw hawinae na coe awh nahan, a thi hah na cat awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang dawk kaawm e kathounge hnonaw hoi nange lawkkamnaw dueng hah na sin vaiteh, BAWIPA ni a rawi e hmuen koe na cet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A moi hoi a thi na kalawt vaiteh, nange BAWIPA Cathut e hmaisawi thuengnae khoungroe van na thueng han. Sathei e a thi hah nange BAWIPA Cathut e thuengnae khoungroe van na awi vaiteh, a moi hah na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut hmalah kahawi ni teh kalan e hno na sak dawkvah, nang hoi na catounnaw hoi cungtalah, hawinae pou na coe awh nahan, nang koe kâ na poe e hete lawknaw hah na tarawi nahanelah kâhruetcuet loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na cei vaiteh na coe hane ram dawk kaawm e miphunnaw hah, nange BAWIPA Cathut ni na hmalah a raphoe toteh, nang ni ahnimanaw hah na pâlei vaiteh, ahnimae ram dawk kho na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na hmalah ahnimouh a rawk awh hnukkhu, ahnimouh ni a sak awh e patetlah na sak awh teh na yon awh hoeh nahanelah, hete miphunnaw ni amamae cathut hah bangtelamaw a bawk awh, kai hai hottelah ka bawk van han telah dei teh, ahnimae cathut kong pacei hoeh nahanelah mahoima kâhruetcuet loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a sak awh e patetlah na BAWIPA Cathut koe na sak awh mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA Cathut ni a ngaihoeh e panuettho e hno hah amamae cathut koe a sak awh teh, amamae capanaw hoi canunaw patenghai amamae cathut hanelah hmai a sawi awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh koe profet hoehpawiteh, mang ka mang thai e buetbuet touh tâcawt boilah, mitnoutnae hoehpawiteh, kângairunae na poe awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hote mitnoutnae hoehpawiteh kângairunae hah akuep nakunghai, nang ni na panue hoeh e alouke cathut koe cet awh sei, bawk awh sei telah ahni ni dei pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hote e profet hoehpawiteh, mang ka mang e lawk hah na tarawi mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh teh nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hah na lungthin buemlahoi thoseh, na hringnae buemlahoi thoseh lung na pataw ou, pataw hoeh ou tie hah panue nahanelah nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmouh na tanouknae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hnuk na kâbang awh han. Takinae lung hoi kâpoelawknaw hah na tarawi awh han. A lawk ngâi laihoi na bawk awh vaiteh, BAWIPA dawk rek na kâhnai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />San lah na onae hmuen Izip ram hoi nangmouh na katâcawtkhai e nangmae BAWIPA Cathut koehoi phen sak hanelah thoseh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk na thui e lam dawk hoi phen sak hanelah a dei awh dawkvah, hote profet hai thoseh, mang ka mang thai e hai thoseh, a due nahanelah na thei awh han. Hottelah nangmouh koehoi yonnae hah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang ni na panue hoeh e, na mintoenaw ni hai a panue hoeh e alouke cathutnaw koe, cet awh sei, bawk awh sei, telah a dei teh, na hmaunawngha, na capanaw, na canunaw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Talai apoutnae koehoi avanglah apoutnae koe totouh, na tengpam vah, a hnai ahlanae koe kaawm e taminaw e cathutnaw ni na ka tacuek nakunghai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nang ni na tarawi mahoeh. A lawk na ngâi pouh mahoeh. Na mit ni pahren mahoeh. Ahni hah na pasai mahoeh. Na hrawk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thei roeroe han. Na thei nahanelah na kut hmaloe na pho vaiteh, hathnukkhu tami pueng ni kut a pho awh van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Santoungnae koe Izip ram hoi nangmouh na katâcawtkhai e na BAWIPA Cathut koehoi pâlei hanelah a kâcai dawkvah, ahni hah talung hoi na dei vaiteh na thei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote kamthang hah Isarelnaw pueng ni a thai awh vaiteh, hot patetlah e hno hah nangmouh thung dawk bout sak laipalah ao awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami kahawi hoeh naw teh nangmouh thung hoi a tâco awh teh, nangmouh ni na panue awh hoeh e alouke cathut koe cei awh vaiteh bawk awh sei telah a dei awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahnimouh ni khocanaw a dum awh e hah, nange BAWIPA Cathut ni na o nahanelah na poe e kho buetbuet touh dawk kamthang na thai pawiteh, hote kong hah kamcengcalah na pacei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kamthang na thai e patetlah kamceng boilah, hot patet e panuettho e hno sak katang pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hote khocanaw hah tahloi hoi na thei han. Khopui hoi khopui dawk kaawm e tami hoi saringnaw pueng koung na raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na lawp awh e hnopainaw pueng kho lungui lam dawk na hmouk awh vaiteh, hote khopui dawk hoi na lawp awh e pueng, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hanelah hmai na sawi awh han. Hote khopui teh songnawng lah pou ao han. A hnukkhu bout kangdout mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a lungkhueknae hue a roum sak teh, na mintoenaw koe lawkkam e patetlah na rungngang vaiteh na pungdaw sak nahanelah, thoebo e hno buet touh boehai lat laipalah, abuemlahoi na tâkhawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni lawk na thui e patetlah BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah ngâi awh nateh, kâpoelawk pueng hah na tarawi vaiteh, BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah, kalan e hno hah sak awh nateh, BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah tarawi awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh teh, BAWIPA Cathut e ca lah na o awh. Kadoutnaw hanelah na tak na kâbouk mahoeh. Na mitmuen hai na ngaw mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmouh teh BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge miphun lah na o awh. BAWIPA ni talai van dawk kaawm e miphun pueng hlakvah, ama ni tawn e miphun lah na o awh nahanelah nangmouh na rawi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Panuetkatho e na cat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ca hane saringnaw teh, maito, tu, hmae,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakhi, sazuk, saya, atha, savi, kahrawngmaito, mon dawk e tu ti e
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khoksamen samka ni teh a thepkaai e pueng teh na ca thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatei, a thepkaai niteh, a khoksamen ka samka e naw thung dawk na ca hoeh hane naw teh, kalauk, saveh, cahi, naw heh athepai eiteh, a khoksamen a samka hoeh dawkvah kakhin e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vok teh a khoksamen a samka eiteh, athepai hoeh dawkvah, nangmouh hanelah a khin. a moi na cat awh mahoeh. A ro hai na tek awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui dawk kaawm e naw thung dawk hetnaw heh na ca awh han. A pathuet hoi a lakep kaawm pueng na ca thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pathuet hoi a lakep kaawm hoeh e pueng na cat awh mahoeh, nangmouh hanelah a khin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kathounge tava aphunphun na ca thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ca hoeh hane tavanaw teh, langta, tuilangta, mataw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />masi, ungngang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />vonga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kalaukva, basairek, batuiling, pingpit,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bukbu, kawhna, balengek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuicawmpai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kahrawngcawmpai, bongpi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a rathei a tawn ei, kâva e saring pueng teh nangmouh hanelah a thoung hoeh dawkvah, na cat awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kathounge tava pueng na ca thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mahmawk kadout e moi na cat mahoeh. Na tengonaw ni a ca hanelah na poe han. Hoehpawiteh, ramlouk e tami longkha thung kaawmnaw koe na yo han. Nangmouh teh nangmae BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge miphun lah na o awh. Hmaeca hah a manu e sanutui hoi mek na thawng mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum tangkuem na law dawk hoi ka tâcawt e pueng pung hra pung touh na kapek awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a min ao nahanelah a rawi e hmuen koe cakang, misurtui, satui hoi tuhu, maitohu naw dawk e camin pung hra pung touh hah a hmalah na ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe awh torei teh, a min ao nahanelah a rawi e hmuen teh, ekvoi ahla dawkvah, pung hra pung touh na phawt thai awh hoeh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hote hno hah na yo vaiteh, tangka na sin vaiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe na cei vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ca han na ngai e patetlah maito, tu, misurtui, yamu tie ca han na ngai e pueng hah na ran vaiteh, BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah, na imthung abuemlahoi na ca awh vaiteh, kanawm lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatei, nangmae longkha thung kaawm e Levih miphunnaw teh, a ham awm hoeh, râw hai ao hoeh dawkvah, na hnoun awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kum thum dawk na hmu awh e pueng hah pung hra pung touh na tâcokhai awh vaiteh, khothung longkha vah na pâkueng awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmouh koe kaawm e ham kaawm hoeh e, râw kaawm hoeh e Levihnaw koe kaawm van e Jentelnaw, naranaw, na longkha thung kaawm e lahmainaw a tho awh vaiteh, a ca awh han. Hottelah na sak pawiteh, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na sak e pueng dawk yawhawi na poe awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sari touh dawk vai touh laiba hloutnae na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laiba hloutnae phung hateh, imri hah hno kacawi sak e ni, hote laiba hah a hlout sak han. BAWIPA e hloutnae tueng lah ao dawkvah, hote laiba hah na imri koe, na hmaunawngha koe na het mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ramlouk koe teh heinae kâ ao. Na hmaunawngha koe teh het laipalah na hlout sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang dawk mathoe ao hoeh nahanelah hottelah na sak han. BAWIPA Cathut ni nama han râw lah na poe e ram dawk nang hah yawhawi moikapap na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni kâ na poe e hete kâpoelawk hah na tarawi nahanelah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah takuetluet thai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk a kam e patetlah yawhawi na poe vaiteh, nang ni ayânaw hah na cawi sak han. Ahnimouh ni teh nang na cawi sak mahoeh. Nang ni miphunnaw hah na uk han. Ahnimouh ni nang na uk awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe ram dawkvah, na longkha thung ka roedeng e na hmaunawngha reira awm pawiteh, hote ka roedeng e na hmaunawngha koe na lungmouk hanh. Na kut hai kasum hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kut hah kakaw lah na kadai vaiteh, a roedengnae a kahma totouh na cawi sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kum sarinae hloutnae kum a pha han a hnai toe. Ka roedeng e hmaunawngha hah utsin laihoi banghai poe hane ngai laipalah, na lungthin dawk kahawi hoeh khopouknae ao hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet awh. Hottelah nahoeh pawiteh, ahni ni BAWIPA koe hram vaiteh, nang dawk yon a pha hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang na onae koe ka roedeng pout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na onae ram dawk, ka roedeng e hmaunawnghanaw hanelah na kut ka kaw lah na kadai nahanelah lawk na thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hmaunawngha reira, Hebru tami napui tongpa teh, nang koe san lah ao teh, kum taruk touh ao hnukkhu, a kum sarinae dawk teh na hlout sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hlout sak toteh kuthrawng na hlout sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe e patetlah na tuhu thung e thoseh, cang katinnae thung e thoseh, misur na katinnae thung e thoseh moikapap na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang teh, Izip ram vah, san lah ouk na o boi e hai thoseh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni nang hah na hlout sak e hai thoseh na pouk han. Hatdawkvah, hete kâpoelawk hah sahnin kai ni na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatei, san niyah, tâco hane ka ngai hoeh. Nang hoi na imthungkhunaw hoi o e a nawm doeh tetpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nang ni phuengvang na la vaiteh, takhang koe a hnâ na kavi pouh vaiteh, ahni teh san lah pou ao han. Hot patetvanlah sannu koehai na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na san na tha navah, arupoung telah pouk hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, kum taruk touh thung san thaw a tawk teh, aphu hoi hlai e hlak let hni touh hoi thaw a tawk toe. Na BAWIPA Cathut ni hai na tawksak e tangkuem dawk yawhawi na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na maitohu hoi tuhu naw thung dawk, camin atan kaawm e pueng teh, na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah a thoung han. Maito camin, tu camin hah na hno mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe, na BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah, a kum tangkuem pout laipalah, na imthungnaw hoi rei na ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote maito tu naw dawkvah, khokkhem, mit ka dawn, a tak dawk yonnae, alouke toun han kawi lah kaawm e buetbuet touh awm pawiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut koe thuengnae na sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na longkha thung na ca han. Sayuk sakhi moi na ca e patetlah kathounge tami, kathounghoehe taminaw ni hai reirei a ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei, a thi teh na cat awh mahoeh. Tui rabawk e patetlah talai dawk na rabawk awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abib thapa hah ya e thapa lah pâkuem awh nateh, ceitakhai pawi lah hno awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Abib thapa dawkvah, BAWIPA ni Izip ram hoi karum vah nangmouh na tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni a min o nahanelah a rawi e hmuen koe maito hoi tu naw hah na thueng vaiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah ceitakhai pawi na to han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang ni Izip ram hoi na tâconae hnin hah na hringyung thung pahnim hoeh nahanelah ceitakhai pawi na to navah, tonphuene vaiyei hah na cat mahoeh. Tonphuenhoehe tie runae vaiyei hah hnin sari touh thung na ca awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Izip ram hoi karangpoung lah na tâco awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnin sari touh thung, na onae ram dawk tonphuene vaiyei awm sak hanh. Apasuek hnin tangmin vah, na thueng e sathei moi hah karuem tuettuet amom totouh na cawi sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e kho longkha koe vah, ceitakhai pawi sak thainae kâ kaawm e nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni a min ao nahanelah a rawi e hmuen koevah, nang teh Izip ram hoi na tâconae tueng, kanî a khup nah tangmin vah, ceitakhai pawi thuengnae hah na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe hmai na pahai awh vaiteh, na ca awh hnukkhu, amom vah im bout na ban awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnin taruk touh thung tonphuenhoehe hah na ca awh han. A hnin sari hnin teh na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge kamkhuengnae hah na sak han. Hote hnin dawk thaw na tawk awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Canga kamtawngnae koehoi na touk vaiteh, yat sari touh aloum hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe e patetlah lungthocalah hoi thueng hane hno hah na sin han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni a min ao nahanelah a rawi e hmuen dawk, na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah yat sari pawi hah na to vaiteh, na capa, na canunaw, na sanpa sannu naw, nang koe kaawm e Levihnaw, imyinnaw, lahmai naranaw pueng ni a lunghawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang teh Izip vah san lah ouk na o e hah na pouk vaiteh, phunglawknaw hah na tarawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cakang hoi misurtui hah na pâkhueng vaiteh, hnin sari touh thung lukkareiim pawi na to han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hote pawi na to navah, nama hoi na capa, na canunaw, na sanpa sannu naw, nang koe kaawm e Levihnaw, imyinnaw, lahmai naranaw na longkha thung kaawmnaw pueng ni a lunghawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe hnin sari touh thung na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge pawi na to han. Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na kampungnae pueng koe, thaw na tawknae pueng koe, yawhawi na poe dawkvah, lunghawinae na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ton phuen hoeh pawitonae tueng, yat sari pawitonae tueng, lukkareiim pawitonae tueng tie naw hah, kum touh dawk vai thum touh, nangmouh tongpanaw pueng teh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe a hmalah na tâco awh han. Hatnavah, Cathut hmalah apihai kuthrawng hoi na tâcawt mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe e patetlah tami pueng ni amamouh a coung thai e patetlah lengkaleng a sin awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe e longkha kaawm e pueng dawk, lawkcengkung, bawinaw hah na onae kho tangkuem dawk na hruek awh han. Ahnimouh ni lawkceng kawinaw hah kalan lah lawk a ceng awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang teh phunglawk dawk hoi na phen mahoeh. Tami minhmai khet na tawn mahoeh. Tadawngnae na dâw mahoeh. Tadawngnae ni tami a lungkaang mit a dawn sak. Tami kalannaw e lawk hah a longkawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram hah nang ni na hring teh na coe nahanelah, kalan e phunglawk dawk dueng na dawn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah na sak e thuengnae khoungroe teng vah, bangpatet e Asherah thing hai na ung mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni a hmuhma e talung nama hanelah na ung mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maito thoseh, tu thoseh, toun kaawm e, kakuep hoeh e hoi na BAWIPA Cathut koe thuengnae na sak mahoeh. Hot patetlah e thuengnae BAWIPA Cathut ni a panuet e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e khonaw dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kanî, thapa, kalvan hno tie patetnaw, kai ni ka pasoung hoeh e alouke cathutnaw koe na cei awh teh, na bawk awh teh, na BAWIPA Cathut e lawkkam na tapuet awh teh, a hmalah yonnae ka sakpayon e napui tongpa ao telah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nang ni kamthang na thai teh akung na khei navah, Isarel miphun dawk hot patetlah e panuettho e hah sakpayon katang pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hote yonnae ka sak e napui tongpa hah kho longkha koe na ceikhai awh vaiteh, talung hoi na dei awh vaiteh na thei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lawkpanuesaknae kapanuekkhaikung kahni touh kathum touh awm pawiteh, due kamcu e tami teh na thei awh katang han. Lawkpanuesaknae kapanuekkhaikung buet touh dueng awm pawiteh, thet mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote tami hah thei hanelah kapanuekkhaikungnaw ni hmaloe a kut a pho awh hnukkhu, tami pueng ni kut a pho awh han. Hottelah na sak awh pawiteh, nangmouh koehoi yonnae teh takhoe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khothung vah tami kâtheinae, kâyuenae, kâhemnae naw hah nang hanlah lawkcengnae ru poung pawiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe na cei awh vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hatnae tueng dawkvah, lawkcengkung thaw ka tawk e, vaihma, Levihnaw e hmalah lawkceng lah ao awh han. Ahnimouh ni hai lawkcengnae hah a pathang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe kaawm e naw ni a dei e patetlah nang ni na sak han. Ahnimouh ni na cangkhai e patetlah na sak nahanelah na kâhruetcuet han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni na cangkhai e lawkcengnae hoi a dei awh e lawk tâtueng e patetlah na sak han. Ahnimouh ni na patue e cangkhainae dawk hoi avoilah aranglah na phen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut hmalah thaw ka tawk e vaihmabawi, lawkcengkungnaw e lawk ngâi laipalah, tarankahawi lah ka sak e teh thei hanlah ao. Hottelah hoi, Isarelnaw thung hoi hot patet e yonnae hah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote kamthang hah tami pueng ni a thai awh toteh, a taki awh vaiteh, hottelah taranhawi laihoi bout sak awh mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk na pha teh, hawvah kho na sak toteh, ka tengpam vah kaawm e Jentelnaw patetlah siangpahrang buetbuet touh tawn awh sei na tetpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e na hmaunawngha reirei duengdoeh siangpahrang lah na tawm a han. Na hmaunawngha lah kaawm hoeh e Jentelnaw hah siangpahrang lah na tawm awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote siangpahrang teh ama hanelah marang moikapap paca mahoeh. Marang moikapap a tawn nahanelah Izip ram tami ban sak mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote lamthung koe bout na ban mahoeh telah BAWIPA ni ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahnie a lungthin a rawp hoeh nahanelah, yu moikapap lat mahoeh. Suingun hai moikapap pâkhueng mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hettelah ao han. A uknaeram bawitungkhung dawk a tahung toteh, Levih tami, vaihma bawinaw ni a tarawi awh e kâlawk hah cauk lah ama hanelah a thut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote cauk teh ama koe ao vaiteh, hnintangkuem a touk han. Hottelah tetpawiteh, BAWIPA Cathut hah a taki nahanelah thoseh, hete kâlawknaw pueng a kuem nahanelah thoseh, a tarawi nahanelah thoseh, a kamtu thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama e a lungthin hah a hmaunawnghanaw lathueng kâtawm thai hoeh. Kâlawk dawk hoi avoilah aranglah kamlang thai hoeh. Hottelah tetpawiteh, a ram thung Isarelnaw rahak vah, ama hoi a canaw teh a hring a saw awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaihmanaw, Levih miphunnaw pueng Isarelnaw hoi cungtalah râw tawn awh mahoeh. Ahnimouh teh BAWIPA koe hmai hoi thuengnae a hamnaw hah a ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh a hmaunawnghanaw hoi râw rei coe awh mahoeh. BAWIPA ni kâ a poe e patetlah ahnimae râw teh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taminaw ni thuengnae a sak awh toteh, maito hai thoseh, tu hai thoseh, vaihmanaw e ham aloung vang, a tangboung roi, a ruennaw hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahmaloe na a e cang, misur, satui hoi tumuen na ngaw e naw hah na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni koehoi a ca catounnaw teh BAWIPA min lahoi a thaw pou tawk nahanelah, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na miphunnaw thung dawkvah ahni hah a rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isarel kho dawk kaawm e Levih tami buetbuet touh ni BAWIPA Cathut ni a rawi e hmuen koe bari laihoi tho pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA hmalah hmuen ka tawn tangcoung e Levihnaw patetvanlah, BAWIPA Cathut min lahoi athaw hah a tawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama e râw a yo teh a hmu e hno touk laipalah, Levihnaw hoi reikâvan lah a coe van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram na pha awh toteh, hote ram dawk kaawm e taminaw ni a sak awh e panuettho e hno hah na sak awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmouh thung dawk a canaw hah hmai hoi ka thueng e, ka tho hane naw hah ama pouk lahoi ka dei e, kutkhetkathoum e, kahawihoehe thoumthainae ka sak e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ân ka thoum e, kahrai kamyawng e, hmaui lah kaawm e, tami kadout ka pacei e tami buet touh boehai awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hottelah ka sak e pueng teh BAWIPA Cathut ni a panuet. Hote panuettho e hnonaw kecu dawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut ni hote miphunnaw teh nang na hmalah hoi a pâlei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang teh, BAWIPA Cathut hmalah toun kaawm hoeh lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na uk e taminaw teh kutkhetkathoum e, ka tho hane naw hah ama pouk lahoi kadeinaw e lawk hah ouk a ngâi awh. Nang teh hottelah na sak nahanelah na BAWIPA Cathut ni kâ na poe hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni, nange na hmaunawnghanaw thung dawk hoi, kai patetlah e profet buet touh nangmouh hanelah a tâco sak han. Hote profet lawk hah na ngâi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Horeb vah na kamkhuengnae hnin navah nang ni, BAWIPA Cathut e a lawk hah bout ka thai awh hanh lawiseh. Hote kalenpounge hmai hah kahmawt awh hanh lawiseh. Ka due han doeh toe telah BAWIPA Cathut hmalah na kâhei e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />BAWIPA ni, ahnimae lawk teh ahawi doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amamae hmaunawngha thung dawkvah, ahnimouh hanelah profet buet touh ka tâco sak vaiteh, ahnie pahni dawk, ka lawknaw hah ka hruek pouh vaiteh, ahni ni patuen a dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote profet ni ka min lahoi a dei e lawk hah tarawi laipalah kaawm e teh, kai ni ka yue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai ni lawk ka poe laipalah, ka min lahoi ka dei e profet hoehpawiteh, alouke cathut min lahoi ka dei e profet teh kadout lah thei han telah kai ni kâ na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang ni, BAWIPA Cathut ni a dei e hah bangtelah hoi maw ka panue han telah na pouk pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />profet ni BAWIPA min lahoi a dei e patetlah phat hoeh, a dei lawk kuep hoehpawiteh, hote lawk teh BAWIPA ni a dei e nahoeh. A taranhawi lahoi a dei e doeh. Ahni hah na taket mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk kaawm e miphunnaw hah, na BAWIPA Cathut ni a pahma teh, ahnimae kho, ahnimae im dawk na o toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e hote ram thung kaawm e khopui kathum touh na hmoun han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami ka thet payon e pueng hote khopui dawk a yawng thai awh nahan, na BAWIPA Cathut ni nama hanlah na poe e ram hah, kathum touh lah na kapek vaiteh, lamthung hai koung na rasoun han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami ka thet payon e ni a hring hlout nahanelah, hote kho dawk a yawng nahane hateh hettelah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thing tâtueng hanelah a hui hoi kahrawng reirei a cei roi teh thing a tâtueng roi navah, cakâ pawk a kârakhing teh a hui a cusin teh a due dawkvah, tami ka thet hoi a kâvan. Hatei, hmuhmanae awm laipalah, a hui hah pouk laipalah a thei payon dawkvah, hote kho buetbuet touh dawk a yawng vaiteh, a hringnae a hlout han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hottelah hoehpawiteh, moipathung han ka ngai e ni hote tami hah pâlei vaiteh, lamhla dawkvah rekpatawt vaiteh a thei payon han doeh. Hottelah thei kawi nahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni ni a hui hah hmuhmanae a tawn hoeh dawkvah, thei hane kawi lah kamcu mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kho kathum touh na hmoun han telah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni lawk na thui awh e hete kâpoelawknaw hah na tarawi awh teh, BAWIPA Cathut lungpatawnae lahoi a lamthung dawk pou na dawn awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />na BAWIPA Cathut ni na mintoenaw koe poe hanelah lawk a kam e ram kaawm e pueng hah na poe vaiteh, na mintoenaw koe lawk a kam e patetlah na ram hah kaw sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na BAWIPA Cathut ni nama hanlah na poe e ram dawkvah, kadout kawi hoeh e ni a due teh, tami thei yonnae na kut dawk a pha hoeh nahanelah, ka dei tangcoung e khopui kathum touh hloilah, alouke khopui kathum touh bout na hmoun han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatei, a hui hah a hmuhma teh, thei hanelah a pahluem teh a thei dawkvah, hote khopui dawk ka yawng ni teh hawvah ka phat nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kacuenaw ni tami a patoun awh vaiteh, hote tami hah bout a hrawi awh vaiteh, moi ka pathung hane kut dawk a poe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnimouh na lungma mahoeh. Na hlout nahanelah, tami thei yonnae hah Isarelnaw koehoi na takhoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni nama hanlah na poe e ram dawk, râw lah na coe e talai dawkvah, ayan mintoenaw ni a ung tangcoung e na imri e lawrilung hah tahruet hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami ni a sakpayon e yon hah lawkceng torei teh, kapanuekkhaikung buet touh dueng pawiteh hote lawk teh cak mahoeh. Kapanuekkhaikung kahni kathum touh awm pawiteh, hote e lawk pueng teh a cak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kahmanhoeh e kapanuekkhaikung buet touh ni, ayânaw koelah kahmanhoeh e kapanuekkhaikung lah kangdout pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka kâtoe roi e roi teh BAWIPA hmalah thoseh, hatnae tueng dawk vaihma, lawkcengkungnaw hmalah thoseh a tho awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />lawkcengkungnaw ni kamcengcalah a pacei navah, hote kapanuekkhaikung ni a hui koe lahoi, kahmanhoeh lah kampangkhai pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a hui koe ka sak han telah a pouk e patetlah ahni dawk na sak han. Nangmouh koehoi yonnae hah hottelahoi na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Alouknaw ni hai hote kamthang hah thai awh vaiteh, hot patet e yon hah bout sak laipalah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungma mahoeh. Hringnae hanelah hringnae, mit hanelah mit, hâ hanelah hâ, kut hanelah kut, khok hanelah khok na pathung awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Taran tuk hanelah na kamthaw navah, namamouh hlak kapap e marang thoseh, rangleng thoseh, taminaw thoseh, na hmawt pawiteh taket hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Izip ram hoi nangmanaw katâcawtkhai e BAWIPA Cathut teh nangmouh koe ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Taran tuk nahane tueng a hnai toteh, vaihmanaw ni a hnai awh vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oe Isarelnaw, sahnin taran tuk hanelah taran koe na hnai awh toe. Ahnimouh kecu dawk na lungpout awh hanh, taket awh hanh, pâyaw awh hanh, kalue awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh na ka rungngang hanelah, BAWIPA Cathut teh nangmouh hoi rei a kamthaw teh, na tarannaw hah na tuk pouh telah taminaw koe dei awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ransa kacuenaw nihai, im katha ka sak niteh, Cathut koe kâhnawng hoeh rae awm pawiteh, ama im ban yawkaw seh, a im hah hnawng naseh. Hoehpawiteh, taran tuknae koe dout pawiteh, alouke ni im hah a hnawng han doeh tie ngaihri han ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Misur takha ka sak niteh, a paw ka cat hoeh rae awm pawiteh, a im ban yawkaw seh. Hoehpawiteh, taran tuknae koe dout pawiteh, alouke ni hote misur paw a ca han doeh tie ngaihrinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A yu sut ka pacei niteh, ka paluen hoeh rae awm pawiteh, a im ban yawkaw seh. Hoehpawiteh, taran tuknae koe dout pawiteh, alouke ni a paluen han doeh tie ngaihrinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi, ransa kacuenaw teh, ka taket ni teh a lung ka pout e awm pawiteh, a im ban yawkaw seh. Hoehpawiteh, ahni a lungpout e patetlah a huinaw hai a lungpout han doeh tie ngaihrinae ao telah taminaw koe a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ransa kacuenaw ni hottelah a dei awh hnukkhu, kâ kapoekungnaw ni taminaw hah taran tuk hanlah a kamthaw sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kho buetbuet touh tuk hanelah na ceisin navah, roum nahanelah hmaloe na dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote kho teh, roum nahane lawk a dei teh kho longkha sut paawng pawiteh, hote kho dawk kaawm e pueng ni aphawng na poe awh vaiteh, na thaw a tawk awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Roum nahane lawk hah ngâi awh hoeh lah, nangmouh na tuk awh pawiteh, hote kho hah na kalup awh vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na BAWIPA Cathut ni nangmae kut dawk hote kho hah na poe torei, tongpa pueng hah tahloi hoi na thei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Napui camo saring khothung na hmu e pueng teh, nama hanelah na la vaiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni taran kut dawk hoi na poe e hno hah na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hete miphun onae kho hloilah, ahlanae koe e kho kaawm e pueng koe hottelah na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni râw lah na coe hane kawi dawk hete miphunnaw e kho dawkvah, ka kâha e tami buet touh boehai na hring sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hitnaw, Amornaw, Kanaannaw, Periznaw, Hivnaw, Jebusitnaw ni amamae cathutnaw koe a sak awh e panuettho e hno hah nangmouh na cangkhai awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na BAWIPA Cathut koe na yon hoeh nahanelah, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na cangkhai e patetlah hote tami pueng hah peng na raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kho buetbuet touh tuk hanelah, kasawlah na kalup pawiteh, thingkungnaw hah na tâtueng mahoeh. Talai dawk kapâw e thingkungnaw teh, tami kâkawk nahanelah ao dawkvah, a paw dueng na ca han. Kho na kalup navah akung na tâtueng mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatei, cakawi hoeh e thingkungnaw teh na tâtueng vaiteh, na tuk e kho na tâ hoehroukrak, taran tuk nahanelah hnopai na sak na thai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni coe hanelah na poe e ram dawk kahrawng vah, tami ni a thei e ro na hmu teh kathetkung na panuek hoehpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kacuenaw hoi lawkcengkungnaw a tho awh vaiteh, ro hoi a tengpam e khonaw hah a hnai ahla e a bangnue awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ro hoi kahnai poung e kho dawk e kacuenaw ni hno boihoeh rae maitola a hrawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hote kacuenaw ni, hote maitola hah, thawn hoeh rae, cati kahei hoeh rae, pou kalawng e palang koe a hrawi awh vaiteh, hote hmuen koe palang vah maitola e lahuen a tâtueng pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levih miphun vaihmanaw ni a thosin awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a thaw tawk hane hoi BAWIPA e min yawhawi poe sak hanelah, ahnimanaw hah BAWIPA ni a rawi toe. Ahnimae pahni dawk hoi, kâyuenae pueng hoi kutkhok payonnae pueng teh pâbaw e lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ro hoi kahnai poung e kho dawk e kacuenaw pueng ni, palang vah a lahuen tâtueng pouh tangcoung e maito van a kut a pâsu awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hathnukkhu ahnimouh ni a dei awh hane teh, kaimae kut ni hete a thi palawng hoeh, kaimouh ni kahmawt awh hoeh. Oe BAWIPA, na rawi teh na rungngang e na tami Isarelnaw yontha pouh haw. A yonnae kaawm hoeh e tami e a thi palawngnae yon hah na tami Isarelnaw koe bawt sak hanh loe. Thi palawngnae yon teh tha pouh loe, telah a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oe! BAWIPA na ratang e na tami Isarelnaw hah pahren haw. Due kamcu hoeh e tami theinae yon teh na tami Isarelnaw koe phat sak hanh loe telah na dei han. Hottelah na tet pawiteh, tami theinae yontha lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah nang ni BAWIPA hma lah hawinae na sak navah, due kamcu hoeh e thi teh a takhoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ni taran na tuk teh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na kut dawk na poe teh na man torei teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na man e taminaw hah a meikahawi e napui hah na hmu teh yu lah la hane na ngai pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nama im na kaw vaiteh, ahni ni a lû a ngaw vaiteh, a kutpatin a raimen vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na mannae khohna a rading vaiteh, thapa yung touh thung a manu na pa rabui laihoi na im vah ao hnukkhu, na yu lah na la vaiteh, ahni teh nange yu lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hathnukkhu ahni hah na ngai hoeh toung pawiteh, ama ngai nah koe na cei sak han. Ahni hah na kaya sak dawkvah, tangka lah na yawt mahoeh. San lah na tat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vâ ka pahren e hoi vâ ka hmuhma e yu roi ni a ca a khe roi teh, camin hah vâ ka hmuhma e capa lah awm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahni ni a râw hah a rei toteh, hmuhma e capa hah pabo vaiteh, a pahren e capa hah na tawmtakhang mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmuhma e capa teh camin doeh telah na pâpho vaiteh, let hni touh e râw hah na poe han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote capa teh na pa e tha kamtawngnae doeh. Caminnae hmuen hoi a kamcu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pa koe capa kathout, a lungpata ni teh manu na pa e lawk ka ngai hoeh e, manu na pa ni a yue ei, banglah ka noutna hoeh e awm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />manu na pa ni hote capa hah a sawn vaiteh, kho thung kacuenaw onae koe kho longkha koe a ceikhai vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kaimae capa teh ka mathout e lah doeh a o. Ka carawng ni teh yamuhri lah kaawm e doeh telah kho thung kacuenaw koe a dei pou han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khoca tongpa pueng ni, hote capa hah talung hoi a dei awh vaiteh, a thei awh han. Hottelah nangmouh thung hoi payonnae hah na takhoe awh vaiteh, Isarelnaw pueng ni hote kamthang hah a thai awh vaiteh a taki awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Due kamcu e yon ka tawn e tami hah thing dawk na kaithi sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hote ro hah thing dawk karum tuettuet na tat mahoeh. Ama hot hnin roeroe vah talai dawk na pakawp roeroe han. Thing dawk kaithi sak e tami teh thoebo lah kaawm e tami doeh. Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na pang hanelah na poe e râw hah na khin sak awh hoeh nahanlah hottelah na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na hmaunawngha e maito hoehpawiteh tu kahmat e hah na hmu nahlangva laplap khen hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hmaunawngha ahlanae koe ao e hah na panue hoeh nakunghai na im vah na hrawi pouh han. Na hmaunawngha ni a tawng hoeh roukrak na im vah na hruek pouh han. Hathnukkhu, na hmaunawngha koe bout na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />La hai thoseh, hnicu hai thoseh, buetbuet touh a kahma e hah na hmawt pawiteh, laplap khen laipalah, hottelah na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hmaunawngha e maitotan nakunghai, la nakunghai lam dawk sut kamlet e na hmawt pawiteh, na kâhrawk takhai mahoeh. Na pathaw roeroe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Napui ni tongpa e khohna hah khohnat mahoeh. Hottelah ka khohnat e teh nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni a panuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lamthung teng thingkung dawk na ou, talai dawk na ou, tavacanaw hoi hoehpawiteh, a taduinaw khuehoi tavatabu na hmu teh, a manu ma ni awt boipawiteh, a canaw khuehoi a manu mek na lat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ni hnokahawi na coe teh na hringyung vang nahanelah, a canaw na la nakunghai, a manu ma teh na tha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Im katha na sak navah, lemphu hah na tumdum han. Hottelah na sak pawiteh, tami buetbuet touh bawt payon pawiteh, nange im teh thipalawngnae im lah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misur dawk kâvan hoeh e atimu na kahei mahoeh. Hottelah na kahei pawiteh, misur paw hoi atimu paw mek a rawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maito hoi la cungtalah laikawk na thawn sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahla hoi tumuen kacokalei e khohna na khohnat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kâkayo e hni hah, arai pali touh dawk na yep han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami buet touh ni a yu a Paluen teh a ikhai hnukkhu a ma teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kai ni hete napui teh ka yu lah ka la toe. Ka ikhai hnukkhu, ahni teh, kacuem e nahoeh tie ka panue telah ati teh, dudamnae lahoi a min mathout sak pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hote napui e a manu hoi na pa ni, tanglakacuem lah a onae hah, kacuenaw koe kho longkha koe a thokhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote napui e a na pa ni kacuenaw koe a dei hane teh, kai ni ka canu teh, hete tongpa koe a yu lah ka poe toe. Hatei, ahni ni a pahnawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khen haw, nange canu teh kacuem e nahoeh ati teh, dudamnae lahoi a min a mathoe sak. Hatei, hetnaw teh ka canu tanglakacuem lah a onae doeh, telah a dei han. Ahnimouh ni kacuenaw e hmalah hni hah a kadai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, kacuenaw ni hote tongpa hah a hem awh vaiteh a yue awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni ahni hah shekel 100 touh a rawng sak awh vaiteh, napui e a na pa hah a poe awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Isarelnaw e tanglakacuem koe min mathoenae hah a sak dawk doeh. Hote napui teh ahnie a yu lah ao han. A due hoeh roukrak hote napui hoi kampek mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatei, tongpa ni a dei patetlah, awm boi, napui e tanglakacuem lah a onae patue thai hoeh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />khothung e tongpanaw ni hote napui hah a na pa im takhang koe a tâco khai awh vaiteh, talung hoi ka dout lah a dei awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a na pa im vah tak a kâyo e lahoi Isarelnaw koe min mathoenae a kamnue sak toe. Hatdawkvah, nangmouh thung hoi yonnae hah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tongpa buet touh teh, a vâ ka tawn e napui buet touh hoi a i roi e hah hmawt pawiteh, napui koe ka ip e tongpa hoi hote napui mek thei han. Hottelah Isarelnaw thung hoi yonnae hah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tanglakacuem hah tongpa ni a hâ hnukkhu, alouke tongpa ni a kho thung vah a hmu teh, ipkhai pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hote napui ni kho thungvah a hram hoeh dawk thoseh, tongpa hai a imri e a yu thama lahoi a ikhai dawk thoseh, nangmouh ni ahni maroi hah kho longkha koe na ceikhai awh vaiteh, talung hoi kadout lah na dei awh han. Hottelah hoi nangmouh thung hoi yonnae hah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tongpa buet touh ni tongpa buet touh hoi sut kâhâ tangcoung e napui hah a hmu teh, a man teh hote napui hah ipkhai pawiteh, hote napui ka ipkhai e tongpa dueng hah na thei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatei, hote napui hah bangtelah hai na tet mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tongpa ni hote napui hah kahrawngum a hmu teh, a hâ tangcoung e napui ni a hram eiteh, ahni kabawm hanelah apihai ao hoeh dawkvah, hote lai teh tami reira kâthei e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tongpa buet touh ni hâ hoeh rah e tanglakacuem hah a hmu teh a man teh, ipkhai pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ahni ka ipkhai e tongpa teh shekel 50 touh napui e a na pa koe a poe vaiteh, hote napui teh, hote tongpa e yu lah ao han. Ahni ni hote napui hah thama lahoi a ikhai dawk doeh. Ahni ni hote napui hah a hringyung thung kapek mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuenla hoehpawiteh, tongpa e puengcang tâtueng lah kaawm e teh BAWIPA e tamihu dawk kâen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cataca teh, BAWIPA e tamihu dawk kâen mahoeh. Se hra totouh kâen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon miphun hoi Moab miphun hai BAWIPA e tamihu dawk kâen mahoeh. Se hra totouh kâen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh ni Izip ram hoi na tâco awh navah, ahnimouh ni vaiyei hoi tui a sin awh teh na dawn awh hoeh. Nangmouh thoebo sak hanelah, Mesopotamia ram, Pethor kho e Beor capa Balaam hah a hlai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei, nange BAWIPA Cathut ni Balaam e lawk tarawi pouh hoeh. Nang na pahren dawkvah, thoebonae hah yawhawinae lah a kâthungsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang teh ahnimae bawirengnae hoi a hnopai na hringyung thung na khen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom miphunnaw hah, na pahnawt awh mahoeh. Ahni teh nange hmaunawngha lah ao. Izipnaw hai na pahnawt mahoeh. Ahnimae ram dawk san lah ouk na o boi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahnimae catoun teh se thum touh hnukkhu BAWIPA e tamihu dawk a kâen thainae kâ ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Taran tuknae koe na kamthaw nah, kamsoumhoehe hno pueng rounh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmouh thung dawk tami bangpatet hai amae a tâco dawk thounghoehnae awm pawiteh, roenae alawilah a tâco han. Roenae thung kâen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangminlasa a pha toteh tui hoi a pâsu han. Kanî a khup torei roenae thung bout a kâen han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaipuen ceinae teh roenae alawilah na ta awh han. Hote hmuen koe alawilah na cei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hnopainaw dawk sumtaboung na tawn han. Nang ni a alawilah na tahung toteh, hot hoi tangkawm na tai vaiteh, na kamlang sin vaiteh, na vaipuen hah na pakawp han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nange BAWIPA Cathut ni nang hah na rungngang vaiteh, na tarannaw hah nang koe na poe nahanelah, roenae thung a kâhlai toe. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA teh nang koe a tho navah, nangmouh koe kathounghoehe hah hmawt vaiteh, nangmouh koehoi a kamlang hoeh nahanelah, roenae teh a thoung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A bawipa koehoi ka yawng niteh, nang koe ka tho e san teh a bawipa koe na ban sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh koe kho a sak thai nahan a ngai poung e hmuen a rawi vaiteh, ao van han. Na pacekpahlek mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isarel napuinaw thung takkâyawt e awm hanh naseh. Napuitongpanaw awm hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Takkâyonae phu hoi ui phu hah na BAWIPA Cathut e im dawk poe hanelah na sin mahoeh. Hot patetlah e hno teh, na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah panuettho e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hmaunawngha koe apung la hanelah, tangka, rawca, apung la thai e hnopai pueng na cawi mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jentelnaw koe apung la hanelah na cawi sak awh han. Na cei awh teh na coe awh hane ram, na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe awh nahanelah, na hmaunawngha koe apung la hanelah na cawi sak awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut koe lawk na kam pawiteh, na kam e patetlah sak laipalah awm hanh. Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni atangcalah, a hei han. Na sak laipalah na awm pawiteh, nang koe a yonae a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei, lawk na kam hoehpawiteh, yon mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawk hah na kâhruetcuet han. Na BAWIPA Cathut koe nama lungtho lahoi na kam e patetlah na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang teh, na imri e misur takha koe na kâen navah, misur paw na ngai totouh na ca han, hatei, na yawngya dawk hoi na phawt pouh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na imri e laikawk na cei navah, na kut hoi cavui hah na pahroe thai. Hatei, na imri e cavui hah tangkoun hoi na ca mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tongpa buet touh ni yu a la teh, a paluen hnukkhu, yon pen hanelah ao dawkvah, a lungkuep hoehpawiteh, manae ca a thut vaiteh, a poe hnukkhu a cei sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hote napui teh a vâ im hoi a cei hnukkhu alouke tongpa e yu lah o thainae kâ ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bout a vâ e ni hai hmawt ngai hoehpawiteh, manae ca a thut teh a kut dawk a poe teh, a im dawk hoi a ceisak nakunghai thoseh, a vâ kadout nakunghai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahmaloe e tongpa ni hote kamhnawng e napui hah a yu lah bout lat mahoeh. BAWIPA hmalah panuettho e lah ao. Na Cathut BAWIPA ni râw lah na poe ram dawk yon na thokhai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yu nuengnueng ka paluen e teh taran tuknae koe cet mahoeh. Rangpui thaw hai patoun mahoeh. Kum touh thung im ao vaiteh, a yu hah a khetyawt han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Talung sum avan lae hai thoseh, athung lae hai thoseh, apini hai laiba dawk na lat pouh mahoeh. Hottelah na lat pawiteh, a hringnae na la pouh e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami ni amae hmaunawngha hai thoseh, Isarelnaw hah a paru teh san lah a ta hai thoseh, a yo hai thoseh, hote tamru hah na hmawt pawiteh, na thei awh han. Nang koehoi yonnae hah hottelah na takhoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hrikbei patawnae dawkvah, Levih ca vaihmanaw ni na pâtu e patetlah na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmouh teh, Izip ram hoi na tâco awh teh, kahlawng na cei awh lahun nah, nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni Miriam koe a sak e hno hah pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ni nama e pacanaw koe hno na cawi sak pawiteh, pâhung e hno la hanelah ahnie im thung na kâen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang teh alawilah na kangdue vaiteh, a pâhung e hno hah nang na onae koe alawilah a sin han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahni teh roedeng pawiteh, a pâhung e hno poe hanelah kanî na loum sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahni ni amae hni a kâkhu laihoi a i vaiteh, nang yawhawi na poe nahanelah, a pâhung e hno hah kanî khum pawiteh, na poe mingming han. Hottelah sak e teh, na BAWIPA Cathut hmalah kalan e hno doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paca reira thoseh, na kho dawk kaawm e Jentelnaw hai thoseh, ka roedeng e hah na rektap mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnintangkuem amae thaw tawk phu hah na poe han. Poe laipalah kanî loum sak hanh. Ahni teh a mathoe dawkvah, a hmu hane aphu dawk a lungpen han. Poe laipalah na awm pawiteh, ahni ni BAWIPA koe hram vaiteh, nang koe yonpennae phat langvaih tie ngaihrinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na pa teh capa e yon kecu dawk thoseh, capa teh na pa e yon kecu dawk thoseh, thet mahoeh. Tami pueng amae yon kecu dawk duenae a khang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kalan lah lawkcengnae koe, Jentelnaw hoi naranaw hah na phen mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang teh Izip ram vah san lah ouk na o e hai thoseh, na BAWIPA Cathut ni hote ram thung hoi na ratang e hai thoseh, na pouk han. Hatdawkvah, hete phunglawk hah na hruek pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang ni na laikawk dawk cang na a toteh, na pahnim e cabong hah bout na lat mahoeh. Na tawksak e pueng dawk na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe nahanelah, hote cabong hah, Jentelnaw hane, naranaw hane, lahmainaw hanelah na hruek han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nange olive paw na karuek toteh, kacawie naw hah bout na karuek mahoeh. Jentelnaw, naranaw, lahmainaw hanelah na hruek pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na misur takha dawk, misur paw na khi toteh, kacawiraenaw hah bout na khi mahoeh. Jentelnaw, naranaw, lahmainaw hanelah na hruek pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmouh teh Izip ram vah san lah ouk na o awh e hah na pouk awh han. Hatdawkvah, hete phung lawk hah na hruek pouh awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami reira kâyue pawiteh, lawkcengim vah a cei awh vaiteh, lawkcengkung ni ahnimanaw hah lawk a ceng han. Kalan e tami hah yon hloutsak nahanelah thoseh, ka yon e teh sungsak nahanelah thoseh lawk na ceng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka yon e hah hem kamcu pawiteh, lawkcengkung ni a hmalah ao sak vaiteh, a yon hoi kamcu lah nâyittouh tie hoi a hem han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, avai 40 hlak kapap lah na hem mahoeh. Hot hlak kapap lah na hem pawiteh, na hmaunawngha teh na hmalah yeirai a phu han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cangkatin lahun e maito hah a pahni moum pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Reirei kaawm e hmaunawnghanaw thung dawkvah, buetbuet touh ni ca sak laipalah dout pawiteh, hote napui teh alouke tamikathan hoi kâyuva mahoeh. A vâ e nawngha ni a paluen vaiteh, a yu lah awm khai naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isarel miphun dawk hmau min a kahma hoeh nahanelah, camin teh, kadout e na pa kacue e min a phu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nawngha ni a hmau e yu hah la hane ngai hoehpawiteh, napui ni kacuenaw onae koe, kho longkha koe a cei vaiteh, ka vâ e nawngha ni, a hmau e min hah Isarel miphun thung caksak hanelah ngai hoeh. A sak hane kawi hai sak hane ngai hoeh telah dei pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />khothung vah kacuenaw ni ahni hah a kaw awh vaiteh, a pacei awh han. Ahni ni hai hote napui hah ka lat ngai hoeh telah muentakuen lah awm pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a hmau e yu ni kacuenaw e hmalah, ahni koe rek a cei vaiteh, ahnie khokkhawm hah a rading pouh vaiteh, a minhmai dawk a tamthawi pouh vaiteh, hmau e im kangdue sak hanlah ka ngai e tami koe hettelah ti hanelah ao telah a dei pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hnukkhu vah, ahni hah khokkhawm rading e miphun telah kaw lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami reira a kâyue awh navah, buet touh e a yu ni amae vâ kabawp han a ngai dawkvah, alouke tongpa e minro hah sawn pouh boipawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hote napui e kut hah tâtueng pouh han. Na pahren mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na yawngya dawk kalen e khinglung, kathounge khinglung tie kâvan hoeh e khinglung na awm sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nama im vah khingnae kalen kathoung na awm sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk na hringyung a vang nahanelah, kahman e khinglung, kahman e yawcu dueng hah na hno han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dei tangcoung e hno ka sak e tami pueng hoi kamsoum hoeh lah ka sak tami pueng teh, nange BAWIPA Cathut ni a panuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang teh Izip ram hoi na tâco teh kahlawng na cei toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na tha a baw teh na tawn lahun nah, na hnukkâbangnaw, a thakayounnaw hah Amaleknaw ni lamthung dawkvah a thei awh e hai thoseh, Cathut hah a taki awh hoeh e hai thoseh, pouk la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut ni râw lah na poe e ram dawk, na tengpam kaawm e taran pueng e kut dawk hoi na hlout sak teh yawhawi na poe toteh, Amaleknaw heh pouknae ao hoeh nahanelah, kalvan rahim vah na raphoe awh han. Hot hah na pahnim mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni râw lah na poe e ram dawk, na kâen teh, na coe hnukkhu hawvah kho na sak awh toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nange na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e na ram dawk e na khi e talai a pawhik a phunphun dawk e aluepaw na la vaiteh, tangthung dawk na raseng vaiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut e min ao nahanelah rawi e hmuen koe na ceikhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawkvah, vaihmanaw koe na cei vaiteh, ahnimouh koe na dei pouh han e teh, maimouh na poe hanelah mintoenaw koe Cathut ni a kam e ram dawk pha awh toe, telah nange BAWIPA Cathut koe sahnin ka pathang telah na dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaihma ni tangthung a la vaiteh, BAWIPA e hmalah a pâhung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang ni na BAWIPA e hmalah na dei hane teh, ka kâva e Aram miphun teh kaie na pa doeh. Ahni teh Izip ram lah a ceicathuk teh, tami youn touh hoi imyin patetlah ao. Hatei, hote hmuen koevah, puenghoi a kampung awh teh, a thao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Izipnaw ni kaimanaw hah na rektap awh teh, kaimouh van vah, thaw karunaw hah a toung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hat toteh, kaimouh ni BAWIPA koe ka hram awh teh, BAWIPA ni kaimae lawk hah a thai teh, kaimae runae, thatawnnae, hoi rektapnae hah na hmu pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni a dâw e thaonae kut hoi, takikatho poung e hoi, mitnout hoi, kângairu hnonaw hoi kaimanaw hah Izip ram thung hoi na tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hete khoitui hoi maito sanutui a lawngnae hmuen hah kaimouh na poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu khenhaw! Oe BAWIPA, nang ni na poe e ram thung e aluepaw hah na thokhai toe telah na dei awh han. Hathnukkhu, nang ni hote aluepaw hah na BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah na pâhung vaiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah na bawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e kahawi e hno pueng dawkvah, nama hoi na imthungkhu hoi, Levihnaw hoi, nangmouh koe kaawm e imyinnaw hoi cungtalah na lunghawikhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang ni, na hmu e thung dawk, hra touh dawk buet touh poenae kum a kum thum kum dawkvah, pung hra pung touh na hruek toteh, Levihnaw, imyinnaw, naranaw, hoi lahmainunaw hah na poe han. Hottelah na sak pawiteh, ahnimouh hai a von a paha van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, nang ni na BAWIPA Cathut e hmalah na dei hane teh, kai ni ka talue sak e poe hane hno im hoi ka takhoe teh, nang ni na dei kâpoelawknaw patetlah imyinnaw, Levih naranaw, hoi lahmainunaw hah ka poe toe. Kai teh nange kâpoelawknaw ka tapoe hoeh. Ka pahnim hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai teh kadoutnaw hanelah ka lungmathoe toteh, hote hnonaw hah ka cat hoeh. Ka khin nah hote hno hah kai ni ka takhoe hoeh. Kadoutnaw hanelah hote hno hah ka poe hoeh. Ka BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah ka tarawi toe. Kai hanelah na dei pouh e patetlah ka tawksak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kathounge na onae hmuen kalvan hoi na khet navah, na tami Isarelnaw hoi kaimae mintoenaw koe lawk na kam e ram, khoitui hoi maitosanutui a lawngnae ram yawhawi poe haw telah na dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sahnin hete phunglawknaw hoi lawkcengnaenaw hah na tarawi nahanelah na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sahnin vah a lamthung dawn laihoi phunglawk, kâpoelawk, lawkcengnae hoi a lawk ngâi hanelah BAWIPA teh na Cathut lah ao nahan na pathang toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang teh amae miphun lah na o titeh a pathang toe. Hatdawkvah, nang ni amae kâpoelawk pueng hah na tarawi hanelah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathloilah, a sak e miphun pueng e lathueng vah oupnae, kamthangnae, barinae lah na o sak han. Ama ni lawk a kam tangcoung e patetlah nang teh BAWIPA Cathut hanelah kathounge miphun lah na o han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Mosi hoi Isarel kacuenaw ni taminaw koe a dei awh e teh, sahnin kai ni ka hruek e kâpoelawk pueng hah tarawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ni Jordan palang na raka teh, BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk na pha toteh, kalen e talungnaw hah ung nateh, thungpangaw hoi na hluk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mintoenaw ni a bawk awh e Cathut BAWIPA ni a lawkkam ao e patetlah nang na poe e ram, khoitui hoi maitosanutui a lawngnae ram kâen hanelah na raka hnukkhu, hete kâlawk dawk e lawklung pueng hah hotnaw dawk na thut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jordan palang raka hnukkhu, sahnin kai ni lawk na thui e talungnaw hah, Ebal mon dawk na ung vaiteh, mirangtalai hoi na kanan han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehai na BAWIPA Cathut hanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thuengnae khoungroe hah talung hoi na sak awh han. Sum hno laipalah, pathei hoehe talung hoi na sak han. Nang BAWIPA Cathut hah hote khoungroe dawk hmaisawi thuengnae na thueng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Roum thuengnae hai na thueng vaiteh, hote hmuen koe na canei awh vaiteh, a hmalah nawmnae na sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote talung dawkvah, hete lawknaw hah kamcengcalah na thut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Mosi hoi vaihmanaw, Levihnaw niyah, Oe Isarel miphun, kâhruetcuet laihoi thai haw. Sahnin nang teh, BAWIPA Cathut e miphun lah na o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na BAWIPA Cathut e lawknaw hah na tarawi han. Sahnin kaimouh ni patuen ka dei awh e kâpoelawknaw hoi phunglawknaw hah tarawi telah Isarelnaw pueng hah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosi ni hot hnin vah, taminaw koe kâ a poe e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nangmouh ni Jordan palang na raka awh hnukkhu, taminaw yawhawi poe hanelah Gerizim mon dawk ka kangdout hane naw teh: Simeon, Levih, Judah, Issakhar, Joseph, hoi Benjamin tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thoebo hanelah Ebal mon dawk ka kangdout hane naw teh: Gad, Reubeb, Asher, Zebulun, Dan, hoi Napthali tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatnavah, Levihnaw ni Isarelnaw koe puenghoi a hramkhai hane lawk teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a panuet e hno, kutsak hlun e meikaphawk ka sak niteh, a kamnuehoehnae koe ka tat e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Manu hoeh pawiteh na pa ka dudam e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Imri e lawrilung ka puen e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mitdawn lam ka phen sak e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kalan lah lawkceng navah, miphun alouknaw, naranaw, lahmainunaw hah kamsoum hoeh lah ka sung sak e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na pa hoi dueng kâkuen e na pa e a yu hah ka ipkhai e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saringnaw buetbuet touh ka ipkhai e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na pa e canu, manu e canu, mae tawncanu ka ipkhai e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Yu e manu ka ipkhai e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Imri hah arulahoi ka thet e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yon ka tawn hoehe tami thei hanelah aphu ka lat e tami teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hete kâlawk dawk e lawklungnaw ka cak sak hoehe teh yawthoenae awm lawiseh telah thoe a bo awh vaiteh, tami pueng ni Amen ati awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sahnin kâ na poe e kâpoelawknaw na tarawi nahanelah, na BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah na ngai pawiteh, BAWIPA Cathut ni nang teh miphunnaw lathueng na tawm han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah na tarawi pawiteh, nang koe ka tho hane yawhawinaw hateh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang teh khothung vah yawhawi, kahrawngum hai yawhawi lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Canaw lahoi thoseh, talai a pawhik lahoi thoseh, saring ni a khe e a canaw lahoi thoseh, tu hoi maitonaw lahoi thoseh, yawhawi lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangthung dawk thoseh, tavai kanawknae kawlung dawk thoseh, yawhawi ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na im thung na kâen nah yawhawi ao han. Alawilah na tâco nah yawhawi ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang na ka tuk hane tarannaw hah na hmalah BAWIPA ni a sung sak han. Ahnimouh teh lamthung buet touh hoi nang koe a tho awh eiteh, lamthung sari touh hoi a yawng awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nange hnoim dawk thoseh, na tawksaknae tangkuem dawk thoseh, BAWIPA nang koe yawhawi pha sak hanelah a dei pouh awh han. BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e ram dawk nang yawhawinae na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang teh na BAWIPA Cathut e kâpoelawk na tarawi teh, a lamthung dawk na dawn pawiteh, BAWIPA ni thoebo e patetlah nang hah BAWIPA hanlah, kathounge miphun lah pou na o sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang teh, BAWIPA e min lahoi kaw lah na o tie miphun pueng ni a panue teh, na taki awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang koe na poe hanelah, mintoenaw koe thoebo e ram dawk hnopai, na canaw, saring pungdawnae hoi talai dawk a pawhik a pung sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA ni atueng a pha torei teh, nange ram dawk kho a rak sak hane thoseh, na sak nah tangkuem dawk yawhawi poe hane thoseh, kalvan hnoim a paawng han. Nang ni miphunnaw hah câwisaknae kâ ao han. Ahnimouh ni nang na cawi sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang teh a mai lah na awm sak laipalah, a lû lah na o sak dawkvah, nang teh rahim lah na awm laipalah, lathueng lah onae kâ na tawn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sahnin kai ni kâ na poe e lawknaw thung hoi avoilah, aranglah phen laipalah, alouknaw e cathut bawk laipalah na awm awh pawiteh, hottelah e hawinae hah na coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahnin ka dei e BAWIPA Cathut ni lawk na poe e pueng na tarawi hanelah, lawk na ngâi hoehpawiteh, na lathueng ka phat hane thoebonae hateh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang teh khothung hai thoseh, kahrawngum hai thoseh yawthoe lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangthung dawk thoseh, tavai kanawknae kawlung dawk thoseh, thoebo lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Canaw lahoi thoseh, talai a pawhik lahoi thoseh, saring ni a khe e a canaw lahoi thoseh, tu hoi maitonaw lahoi thoseh, thoebo lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na im thung na kâen nah thoebo lah na o han. Alawilah na tâco nah thoebo lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />BAWIPA na pahnawt teh na sakpayon e yon kecu dawk, karang poung lah rawknae koe na pha hoehroukrak, na tawksak e pueng dawk rektapnae, tarawknae, pathoenae naw teh na lathueng vah a pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na cei teh na coe hane ram dawk hoi be na raphoe hoehroukrak, lacik ka pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />BAWIPA ni laheipatawnae, vairoe, ekkhu, vuenpatawnae, tahloi hoi theinae, kahlî hoi thingthairompo due saknae, ahri ni ca e lahoi thingthairompo due saknae, khokangnae naw hoi na rawk totouh, hote laciknaw ni na pâlei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lathueng e kalvan teh na lû dawk rahum patetlah thoseh, na rahim e talai hai sum patetlah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />BAWIPA ni na ram dawk ka rak e kho hah lailo hoi vaiphu lah ao sak dawkvah, na rawk hoehroukrak kalvan lahoi na van a bo sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tarannaw hmalah BAWIPA ni lacik na poe han. Lamthung buet touh dueng dawk hoi na cei sin ei, lamthung sari touh dawk hoi na yawng awh vaiteh, talai van kaawm e khoram tangkuem na kampuen awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na ro teh tavanaw, kahrawng e moithangnaw ni ca hanelah ao han. Hote moithangnaw hah apinihai pâlei mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang hah Izip ram e âhlut, baksa, takpatha e lahoi lacik na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathunae, mitdawnnae, lungpuennae lacik a pha sak vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mitdawn ni hmonae koe a payam e patetlah nang teh kanîthun vah thupthup na payam han. Na sak e hno dawk na cum laipalah, rektapnae, lawpnae na khang vaiteh, apinihai na rungngang mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yu na paluen eiteh, ayânaw ni a ikhai han. Im na sak eiteh, na awm nah mahoeh. Misur na ung eiteh, a paw na khi mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na maito hah na hmalah a thei awh eiteh, nama ni na cat mahoeh. Nange la hah na hmalah thama lahoi a ceikhai awh eiteh, bout na poe awh mahoeh toe. Nange tunaw hah taran kut dawk poe toteh, ka rungngang hane awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na canaw teh ayâ kut dawk a pha teh, na mit ni kanîruirui a khet vaiteh, a tha a baw han. Na kut hai a tha awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na panuepaca hoeh e miphun ni na ram dawk e a pawhik hai thoseh, na tawk teh na hmu e hnonaw hai thoseh a ca awh han. Nang teh rektapnae dueng doeh pout laipalah na khang ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hottelah, ma ni khei kâhmo e dawkvah, nang teh na pathu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />BAWIPA ni na khokpakhu hoi na khok hloilah, na khoktabei koehoi kamtawng teh, na laduem koe totouh, kahmat thai hoeh e lacik a pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang ni na tawm e siangpahrang hah, nang hoi na mintoenaw ni a panue boihoeh e miphun koe, na thak vaiteh, nang teh alouke cathut, thing cathut, talung cathutnaw hah na bawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nang na thaknae ram tangkuem dawkvah, nang teh, kângairunae, bangnuebangta nahane, pathoe hanelah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nang ni cati moikapap laikawk koe na sin eiteh, awsinaw ni a ca dawkvah, cakang youn touh ca doeh na a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Misur takha na sak teh, misur ka ung nakunghai, ahri ni a ca dawkvah, nama ni misur paw na khi mahoeh. Misur tui hai na net mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na onae koe olivekung ao eiteh, a paw hmin hoehnahlan a sarut dawkvah, nang teh olive satui na kâhluk mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Canu capa na khe eiteh, ahnimouh hoi na nawm mahoeh. Taran ni san lah a man han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na onae ram dawkvah, thing kaawm e pueng, talai a pawhik kaawm e pueng, awsi ni a ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang hoi rei kaawm e imyinnaw teh, rasang vaiteh, nang van a luen awh han. Nang law teh rahim lah na kum han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahni ni nang na cawi sak vaiteh, nang ni ahni na cawi sak mahoeh. Ahni ni a lû lah awm vaiteh nang law teh a mai lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bawi ni na poe e kâpoelawknaw hoi BAWIPA e phunglawknaw hah tarawi nahanelah na BAWIPA Cathut e lawk na ngâi hoeh dawkvah, nang teh, na rawk totouh hete thoebonae teh nang lathueng phat vaiteh, na pâlei vaiteh rek na patawt han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nang lathueng thoseh, na catounnaw lathueng thoseh, pout laipalah mitnoutnae kângairu hno lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hnopai na tawn toteh, lunghawinae hoi BAWIPA Cathut e a thaw hah na tawk awh hoeh dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a patoun e tarannaw e thaw hah vonhlam hoi, tui kahran hoi, caici lah onae hoi bangpueng dawk roedeng laihoi na tawk awh han. Na rawk awh hoehroukrak na lahuen dawk sumkahnam a bang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahla poungnae koe e miphunnaw hah nangmouh tuk sak hanelah, BAWIPA ni patoun vaiteh, mataw kamleng e patetlah a tho awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A lawk na thai awh hoeh e miphun, kacuenaw hai ka bari hoeh e miphun, kanawnaw hai ka pahren hoeh e miphun, ka matheng e miphun lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Na rawk awh hoehroukrak, taran ni na tuca, maitoca, talai a pawhik ca hane, cakang, misurtui, satui pueng nang hanelah pek mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na ram dawk e na kâuep e khopui rapannaw pueng a tip awh hoehroukrak, na khoram kaawm e pueng a kalup awh han. Na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e na ram kaawm e pueng, na khoram kaawm e pueng dawk hai thoseh a kalup awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na taran ni khik na kalup dawkvah, na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe e canu capa camosennaw e moinaw hah na ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Na onae kho hah taran ni khik a kalup toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />a nuen kahawi e tongpa ni a takang lawi vah, amae hmau, a pahren e a yu, hoi a pek e a canu capanaw patenghai yah, rei van laipalah a ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na onae kho hah taran ni khik a kalup teh runae na kâhmo toteh, a takthai a naw lawi vah, talai patenghai ka coungroe boihoeh e napui ni hai, a pahren e a vâ, a canu hoi a capa patenghai hmawt ngai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A khe e camonaw hoi a thunnaw patenghai arulahoi a ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Na BAWIPA Cathut, ka lentoe ni teh takikatho poung e min hah taki hanelah thoseh, hete kâlawk dawk thut lah kaawm e hete lawklungnaw pueng hah kâhruetcuet lahoi na tarawi hoeh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />nange lacik hoi na ca catounnaw koe ka phat hane lacik hah atueng ka saw sak vaiteh, dam thai hoeh e kângairu han kawi hah BAWIPA Cathut ni a tho sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hotnaw e hmalah, nang ni na taki e Izip ram e patawnae pueng hai BAWIPA ni nang dawk a pha sak han. Hotnaw teh nang dawk a kâbet awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Hothloilah, hete kâlawk cauk dawk thut lah kaawm hoeh e patawpanatnae lacik kaawm naw pueng hai, na rawk hoehroukrak BAWIPA ni nang dawk a pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Kalvan e âsi yit touh na kapap awh nakunghai, BAWIPA Cathut e lawk na ngâi awh hoeh dawkvah, kayounca lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />BAWIPA ni nangmouh hanlah hawinae sak e hoi pungdaw sak hanelah a ngai e patetlah nangmouh lathueng rawknae pha sak hane hoi nangmouh raphoe e dawk a lunghawi teh, coe hanelah na kâen sin awh e ram thung hoi phawk lah na o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni talai poutnae koehoi avanglah apoutnae koe totouh, miphun pueng koe na kâkahei sak han. Hawvah, na mintoenaw ni a panue awh hoeh e thing cathut, talung cathutnaw hah na bawk awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Hote miphunnaw rahak vah, nang teh roumnae awm mahoeh. Na khok kâhatnae awm mahoeh. Lungtâsuenae, mit thayounnae, hoi lungthoengnae hah BAWIPA ni na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Nang teh karum khodai pout laipalah, lungpuennae hoi, kadout han na ou, ka hlout han na ou tie panuek laipalah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Na lungthung vah takinae, na mit hoi na hmu e hno dawkvah, nang ni amom vah tangmin a pha lei saw na ti vaiteh, tangmin vah, amom a pha lei saw na ti han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Hote lam hah bout na hmawt awh mahoeh toe ka tie lam dawk hoi BAWIPA ni nang hah Izip ram lah lawng hoi bout na thak dawkvah, hote ram dawk sanpa sannu lah o hanelah, tarannaw koe na yo awh han. Hateiteh, apinihai nang hah na ran ngaihoeh telah Isarelnaw koe a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hethateh, Horeb hmuen koe Isarelnaw hoi BAWIPA ni lawkkam e hloilah, Moab ram dawk Isarelnaw hoi lawkkam hanelah, Mosi koe a dei pouh e lawkkam lawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosi ni Isarelnaw pueng ama koe a kaw teh, nangmouh ni patuen bout na dei awh hane teh, Izip ram Faro siangpahrang hoi a taminaw hoi a ram pueng e lathueng na mithmu roeroe vah, BAWIPA ni a sak e pueng teh be na hmu awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanouknae, mitnoutnaw, hoi kângairu hnonaw hah na mit hoi roeroe na hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei, thaipanueknae lung, hmuthainae mit, thaithainae hnânaw hah sahnin ditouh na poe awh hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kum 40 touh thung kahrawngum vah nangmouh na hrawi awh toe. Nangmae khohna pawn hoeh. na khokkhawm hai pawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />BAWIPA teh nangmae BAWIPA Cathut lah ao tie na panue awh nahanelah, nangmouh ni vaiyei na cat awh hoeh, misur hoi yamu hai na net awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hete hmuen koe na pha awh navah, Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon hoi Bashan siangpahrang Og tinaw teh, kaimouh na tuk hanelah a tho awh teh, kaimouh ni ka tâ awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aram ka la awh hnukkhu Reuben, Gad, Manasseh miphun tangawn naw hah râw lah ka poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tawksak awh e hno pueng dawkvah, hawinae na coe awh nahanelah, hete lawkkam heh kuen awh nateh hringkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atuvah miphun kahrawikung abuemlahoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kacuenaw hoi kahrawikungnaw, Isarelnaw pueng, camosennaw, na yunaw, na imluennaw, na thing katâtuengnaw, na tui kadonaw totouh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sahnin BAWIPA ni nangmouh koevah, thoebo lah kaawm e lawkkam thungvah na kâen awh thai nahane hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na pa Abraham, Isak, hoi Jakop hoi nangmouh koe lawk a kam teh a dei tangcoung patetlah nangmae Cathut lah ao thai nahane hoi a tami lah na o thai nahanelah caksak lah na o awh nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thoebonae hoi lawkkamnae hah nangmouh koe dueng ka sak e tho hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahnin BAWIPA Cathut hmalah kangdout e hoi atu hi kaawm hoeh e naw koehai a sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Bangkongtetpawiteh, Izip ram vah bangtelamaw khosak awh tie hoi nangmouh ni na ceinae miphunnaw e rahak vah bangtelamaw na cei awh tie hai na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahnimae panuettho e hnopainaw hoi, ahnimouh koe kaawm e thing, talung, sui, ngun naw hoi sak e ahnimae meikaphawknaw hah nangmouh ni na hmu awh toe. )
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut koehoi phen hane ngainae lungpouk na tawn awh teh, hote miphunnaw e cathutnaw koe na cei awh teh, tongpa, napui, imthung thoseh, miphunnaw hoi ka cet e, kakhat e a paw lungkhueknae a paw, a khongyang teh nangmouh dawk a paw han tie thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hot patetlae tami teh, thoebonae lawk a thai navah, a lungpata e patetlah ka sak vaiteh, tui kahrannae dawk paruinae mek bawksak nakunghai, lungmawng lah ka o han ka tet e awm langvaih tie ngaihrinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahni teh BAWIPA ni pasai hoeh, dipmanae, lungkhueknae hmaikhu a tâco teh, Cakathoung dawk thut e thoebonae naw ahnimae lathueng ao han. BAWIPA ni ahnie min teh, kalvan rahim a raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hete kâlawk cauk dawk thut e thoebonae lawkkam e patetlah Isarel miphun pueng thung hoi BAWIPA ni a kapek han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ram thungvah BAWIPA ni a poe hane lacik hoi patawnae hah na hnuklah ka tho hane sekatha na catounnaw hoi ahlanae koehoi ka tho hane ramlouk e taminaw ni a hmu awh toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ram thungvah gan, palawi, hoi hmaisaan, cati patue thaihoehnae, apawhik a tâcohoehnae, a lungphuennae hoi a lungkhueknae hoi BAWIPA ni a tâkhawng e Sodom hoi Gomorrah hoi Admah hoi Zeboiim patetlah a tâkhawng e a hmu awh toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />miphun pueng ni, bangkongmaw BAWIPA ni hete ram heh hettelah a sak. Hete kalenpounge lungkhueknae heh bang nama aw ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hattoteh taminaw ni, Izip ram hoi a tâcokhai navah, ahnimouh hoi lawk a kam e ahnimae mintoenaw e BAWIPA Cathut e lawkkam hah a ceitakhai awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ahnimouh hanelah banghai ka pouk thai hoeh e cathut alouke, a panue awh boihoeh e cathut thaw a tawk awh dawk doeh ati awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hete cakathoung dawk thut lah kaawm e thoebonae pueng, hete ram dawk phasak hanelah, BAWIPA a lungkhuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />BAWIPA ni lungphuennae, puenghoi lungkhueknae, Lungphuennae hoi ahnimae ram dawk hoi ahnimouh hah a rasa teh, sahnin e patetlah alouke ram dawk a pâlei toe tie hah doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni na hreknae miphunnaw pueng koe kaawm e na hmalah ka hruek e yawhawinae hoi thoebonae hah na panue awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA koe bout na ban awh teh, atu kâ na poe e patetlah nama hoi na canaw hoi na lungthin, hringnae abuemlahoi a lawk na tarawi awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni san coungnae koehoi na ban sak awh vaiteh, na pahren awh han. Hahoi BAWIPA ni miphun pueng koe kâkayeinae koehoi bout na pâkhueng awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmouh thung dawk talai pout totouh pâlei e awm pawiteh, BAWIPA na Cathut ni hote hmuen koehoi bout na pâkhueng awh vaiteh, hote hmuen koehoi bout na tâcokhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mintoenaw ni a pang e ram koelah, bout na hrawi awh vaiteh, na pang a han. Hatnavah bout na pahren awh vaiteh mintoenaw hlak hoe na pung sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hring thai nahan, BAWIPA na Cathut hah lungthin, hringnae abuemlahoi lungpataw sak hanlah, BAWIPA na Cathut ni na lungthin hoi na catounnaw e lungthin vuensom a a pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang na ka taran ni teh na kapacekpahleknaw, lathueng hai thoseh, ka dei tangcoung patetlah thoebonae pueng ka pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bout na ban vaiteh, BAWIPA e a lawk dei e na tarawi vaiteh, sahnin na poe e kâpoelawknaw pueng na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang ni na BAWIPA Cathut e lawk hah na tarawi teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kâlawk cauk dawk thut e lah kaawm e phunglawk pueng na tarawi pawiteh, na BAWIPA Cathut koe na lungthin abuemlahoi bout na ban pawiteh, na tawk e pueng dawk tânae na hmu awh nahan hoi na canaw, saringnaw, apawhiknaw pung sak vaiteh, nang han hawinae na sak pouh han. BAWIPA teh na mintoenaw koe a lunghawi e patetlah nang dawk a lunghawi vaiteh, nang hanelah ahawinae lah a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahnin na poe e lawk teh na thaipanuek hoeh e lawk nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang hoi kâhlat hoeh. A lawk ngâi awh teh tarawi nahanelah, kalvan vah apimouh ka luen vaiteh, maimouh koe ka thokhai tie hah pacei sak hanelah kalvan vah kaawm e nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lawk teh maimouh ni ngâi awh teh, tarawi awh nahan, talî apimaw ka rakat ni teh maimouh koe ka thokhai han telah ka pacei hanelah talî namran lah kaawm e nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lawk teh na tarawi nahanelah nang hoi a hnai poung. Na pahni dawk thoseh, na lung dawk thoseh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenhaw! hringnae hoi hawinae, duenae hoi thoenae heh sahnin na hmalah ka hruek
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na hring teh na pungdaw nahan hoi na pang hane ram dawk na BAWIPA Cathut ni yawhawi na poe nahan na Cathut hah na lungpataw han, a hnuk na kâbang vaiteh, kâpoelawknaw, phunglawknaw, hoi lawkcengnaenaw hah tarawi loe telah lawk na thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei, na lungthin hah alouklah a kamlang teh, lawkngai laipalah tami dumnae koelah na kamlang teh alouke cathut na bawk pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jordan tui na raka teh na pang hane ram dawk na hring saw mahoeh. Atangcalah rawknae koe na pha han telah sahnin kâhruetcuetnae na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hringnae hoi duenae, yawhawi poenae hoi thoebonae naw na hmalah ka hruek. Nama hoi na canaw ni hring nahanlah rawi lawih. Kapanuekkung kalvan hoi talai ka kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nang hoi na catounnaw ni na hring nahan hoi nange BAWIPA Cathut na lungpataw teh a lawk na tarawi dawkvah, hringsawnae na kapoekung BAWIPA hah na kâhnai nahan thoseh, BAWIPA ni na mintoe Abraham, Isak, Jakop koe thoebo e ram dawk o hane hoi kâvan e hringnae rawi loe telah thoseh Isarel miphun koe a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosi ni a cei teh Isarel miphun pueng koe bout a dei pouh e lawk teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kai kum 120 a kuep toe. Nangmouh koe ka kâhlai thai hoeh toe, BAWIPA ni hai Jordan palang na rakat mahoeh ati toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni na hmalah a raka teh hote khocanaw a raphoe vaiteh, ahnimae hmuen nangmouh ni na pang awh han. BAWIPA ni a dei e patetlah Joshua ni nangmae hmalah a raka han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA ni hai Amor siangpahrang Sihon hoi Og dawk thoseh, a raphoe e ahnimae ram dawk thoseh, a sak e patetlah hote khocanaw dawk a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />BAWIPA ni ahnimouh nangmouh koe na poe vaiteh, lawk na poe e patetlah ahnimouh dawk a sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tha kâlat awh nateh, na taranhawi awh. Na lungtâsue awh hanh. Ahnimouh taket awh hanh. BAWIPA teh nangmae Cathut lah ao. Nangmouh hoi rei ka cet e teh BAWIPA doeh. Na hnoun mahoeh, na cettakhai mahoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua bout a kaw teh, tha kâlat nateh na taranhawi haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni hete tami koe poe hanlah, mintoenaw koe thoebo e ram koelah ahnimouh hoi rei na cei vaiteh, râw na pang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hmalah BAWIPA a cei han, nang hoi rei ao han, hnuklah na kamlang takhai mahoeh, tâsue hanh, na lungpout hanh, telah Isarel miphunnaw hmalah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi ni hete kâlawk a thut teh, BAWIPA e lawkkam thingkong kâkayawn e Levih miphun vaihmanaw, Isarel miphun kacuenaw koe a poe teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lawk a thui e teh, kum sari akuep nah sannaw hlout nahan sut oup e lukkareiim pawi tueng a pha navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmae BAWIPA Cathut ni rawi e hmuen koe Isarel miphun pueng teh, a ham lah kâpâtue hanelah a tho awh toteh, hete kâlawk hah tamimaya hmalah na touk pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tongpa, napui, camonaw nangmouh koe kaawm e imyinnaw ni a thai awh teh a kamtu awh teh BAWIPA na Cathut hah a taki awh teh hete kâlawk pueng hah kâhruetcuet laihoi a hringkhai awh nahanlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka thai hoeh rae a canaw ni hai a thai awh nahanlah Jordan palang namran lah cei vaiteh na pang awh hane ram dawk na o awh nathung BAWIPA na Cathut takinae a kamtu thai awh nahanlah pâkhueng loe telah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Mosi koe, na due nahane tueng a hnai toe, Joshua kaw nateh kamkhuengnae lukkareiim koe hnai awh. Ahni lawk ka thui han telah atipouh. Hateh Mosi hoi Joshua teh kamnue hanelah kamkhuengnae lukkareiim koe a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />BAWIPA ni lukkareiim dawk tâmaikhom hoi a kamnue pouh teh, tâmaikhom ni lukkareiim takhang koe a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Mosi koe, na mintoenaw hoi na i han toe. Hete miphunnaw ni atu a pâtam awh e ram dawk kaawm e Jentelnaw ni a bawk e cathutnaw hoi a yon awh teh kai na pahnawt awh vaiteh lawkkam a raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hat toteh, kai ka lungkhuek vaiteh, ahnimouh ka kamlang takhai han. A rawk awh vaiteh lungpoutnae hoi rucatnae puenghoi a kâhmo awh han, hatnavah ahnimouh ni Cathut ni maimouh koe ao hoeh dawk hete rucatnae maimouh lathueng a pha nahoehmaw telah a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni alouke cathut koe a kamlang awh e yonae dawk, kai ni minhmai ka hro han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hete la heh ahnimouh han thun pouh. Isarelnaw cangkhaih, Isarelnaw e kong dawk kapanuekkhaikung lah ao nahan a pahni dawk hrueng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a na mintoenaw koe thoe ka bo e sanutui hoi khoitui a lawngnae ram koe ka hrawi awh vaiteh, ka boum lah a ca awh hnukkhu a thaw awh vaiteh cathut alouke koelah a kamlang awh han. A thaw tawk awh vaiteh kai na taran awh han, ka lawkkam a raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rucatnae hoi yawthoenae pueng a kâhmo awh navah, hete la heh amamouh kapanuekkhaikung lah ao nahan a catounnaw e pahni dawk hai pahnim awh mahoeh. Kai ni thoeboe e ram dawk ka ceikhai hoehnahlan atu patenghai a pouknae ka panue toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosi ni hai hote hnin navah la a thut teh Isarelnaw a cangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nun capa Joshua koe, tha kâlat nateh na taranhawi sak. Kai ni thoe ka bo e ram dawk Isarelnaw na kâenkhai han. Kai ni na okhai han, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosi ni hete kâlawknaw cauk dawk be a pakhum hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lawkkam thingkong ka hrawm e Levihnaw a kaw teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hete kâlawk cauk lat awh nateh, namamouh na kapanuekkhaikung lah BAWIPA e lawkkam thingkong hmalah hrueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmae miphun teh taranthawnae, lungpatanae na tawn awh tie ka panue. Khenhaw! sahnin na hringkhai nah patenghai BAWIPA na taran awh nahoehmaw. Ka due hnukkhu nah tawng teh hothlak na sak awh han rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangmae miphun dawk kacuenaw, kaukkungnaw abuemlah kai koe kamkhueng awh naseh. Hete lawknaw hah ahnimouh koe ka dei pouh vaiteh, kalvan hoi talai ka kaw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai ka due hnukkhu teh, khoeroe na rawk awh vaiteh, kai ni lawk na thui e lamthung dawk hoi na phen awh han tie hah ka panue. Hmalah toteh BAWIPA hmalah yonnae na sak awh vaiteh, na kut hoi na sak awh e lahoi a lungkhueknae na hroecoe awh dawkvah, nangmouh teh runae hoi na kâhmo awh han telah kâhruetcuetnae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hottelah Mosi ni Isarel maya thainae koe hettelah lawknaw heh apout totouh koung a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oe kalvannaw thai awh haw, lawk ka dei han. Oe talai ka dei e lawk thai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaie phunglawk teh kho patetlah masimmasim a rak han. Ka lawk teh tadamtui patetlah a bo han. Patue e naw dawk ka rak e kho patetlah thoseh, phonaw dawk moikapap e kho patetlah thoseh ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />BAWIPA e min teh ka pâpho, maimae Cathut lentoenae teh pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama teh lungsongpui doeh, a tawksak e akuep. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lamthung teh a lan, yuemkamcu e Cathut, yon tawn hoeh, katang e hoi kalan e BAWIPA lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh a rawk awh toe. Cathut e ca lah awm awh hoeh, toun hoeh kawi lah awm awh hoeh. A lungthin a longkawi teh ka payon e miphun lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oe lungangnae ka tawn hoeh e kapathunaw, BAWIPA e pahrennae hettelamaw na pathung awh han. Ka kawkhikkung na pa nahoehmaw, na sak awh teh na caksak awh hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ayan e taminaw pahnim hanh awh, Se moi kaloum tangcoung e pouk awh, na pa pacei nateh na dei pouh han, kacuenaw pacei nateh ahnimouh ni a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lathueng Poung ni Adam catoun lah kaawm e naw hah a kapek teh, râw a rei navah, Isarelnaw a youn a pap e hah a khet teh miphun onae hmuen a khuen pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BAWIPA e ham teh a taminaw doeh. Jakop teh a coe e râw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami kingdinae koe sarang a hram, thingyeiyawn koe Jakop a hmu toteh, khik a vuiluk teh mitmu patetlah a ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mataw ni a tabu a raphoe teh, a canaw lathueng a rathei a kadai teh, a canaw a rathei hoi a tawm e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA dueng ni doeh Jakop a hrawi, alouke cathut ahni koe awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Talai rasangnae koe hmuen a poe teh, talai a pawhik hah a ca teh, lungha dawk e khoitui hai thoseh, lungtaw dawk e satui hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuca thaw, Bashannaw e tutan, maitotan, hmae thaw, satun, kuen dawk e ahrei, maito sanutui, tu sanutui nei hane hoi misur tui thipaling na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatei, Jeshurun teh a thâw dawk khok hoi a pâthui. Na thâw, na len, ahrei hoi na kawi dawkvah, na kasakkung Cathut na pahnawt teh rungngangnae lungsong banglahai na noutna hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh alouke cathut lahoi utsin sak awh. Panuet ka tho e hno lahoi a lungkhuek sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut hoeh e kahrai, panue boihoeh e cathut, mintoenaw ni a taki awh hoeh e cathut koe thuengnae a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kasakkung lungsong banglahai na ngâi awh hoeh. Na pa lah kaawm e Cathut hah na pahnim toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />BAWIPA ni hot hah a hmu nah, a lungkhuek, a canu capanaw ni a pahnawt dawkvah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai ni ka minhmai ka hro han, bangtelamaw apoutnae ao han tie ka khet han, lungkapatak e miphun, yuemkamcu hoeh e canaw lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cathut lah kaawm hoeh e hno lahoi utsinnae tawn sak hanelah a sak awh toe. Ayawmyin e hnopai lahoi lung na khuek sak awh toe. Hatdawkvah, miphun lah kaawm hoeh e lahoi ahnimouh utsin sak hanelah lungkaang hoeh e miphun lahoi lungkhueksak hanelah ka sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka lungkhuek teh hmai ka sawi. Kadung poung e sheol totouh a kak han. Talai dawk e a pawhik kamtawisak vaiteh mon kamhungnae totouh a kak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahnimouh lathueng runae ka thueng pouh han, kaie palanaw hah koung ka ka han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vonhlamrinci a khang awh han. Kâannae, puenghoi rawknae lahoi a rawk awh han. Sarangnaw e hâ thoseh, talai dawk kaawm e tahrunsue thoseh, ahnimouh koe ka patoun han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Alawilah tahloi hoi duenae, imthung taki ka tho e runae ni thoundoun tangla thoseh, sanu ka net lahun e camo hoi a sam ka po tangcoung e matawng thoseh a raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Taran kâoupnae ka taket hoeh nakunghai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tarannaw a kâoup awh teh, hete hnopueng BAWIPA ni sak hoeh, ka lentoe e maimae kut ni doeh a sak ati han. Kai lungpuen han ka tawn hoeh nakunghai ahnimouh hah talai pout totouh kampek sak vaiteh, apinihai a pouk hoeh nahanlah ka raphoe han telah pouknae ka tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungangnae tawn awh hoeh, poukthainae hai tawn awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lungangnae tawn awh pawiteh, hete hno heh a thaipanuek awh han ei, hmalae kong hah a pouk awh han ei telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kângue awh e lungsong ni ahnimouh yawt awh hoeh, BAWIPA ni ahnimouh poe hoehpawiteh, tami buet touh ni tami 1,000 touh bangtelamaw a pâlei thai han. Tami kahni touh ni tami thong hni touh bangtelamaw yawngsak thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Maimae tarannaw ni a hmunae dawk teh ahnimae lungsong hoi maimae lungsong kâvan hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahnimae misurkung teh Sodom ram e doeh. Gomorrah talai dawk ka pâw e a kung doeh. Ahnimae misurpaw teh kakhat e a kung dawk e a paw lah ao teh, misurbomnaw teh kakhat e hoi doeh a kawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahnimae misurtui teh khorui sue, ka patawpoung e hrunthoe sue lah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hothateh kai koe a pâtung toe. Hnoim dawk hruek lah awm hoehnamaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moipathungnae teh kai ni ka sak hane doeh. Atueng akuep toteh ahnimae khok a tâlaw han. Ahnimouh koe runae pha nahane tueng a hnai toe. A kâhmo awh hane runae karangpounglah a tho han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a taminaw hanelah lawk a ceng han. A taminaw teh bahu a baw toe, a paung e ka hlout e buet touh boehai ao hoeh e hah a hmu navah, ahnimouh pahren vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahnimae cathut, ahnimouh ni a kângue awh e talung nâne ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a thuengnae a thâw hah a ca awh teh, nei thuengnae misur kanetnaw teh namaw ao. Thaw awh naseh, nangmouh na kabawm awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kai, kama roeroe Cathut tie thoseh, kai hloilah alouke cathut awmhoeh tie thoseh, khenhaw! ka thei thai, ka hringsakthai, moihna ka thosak thai, ka damsak thai, ka kut dawk hoi apini na lawm thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A yungyoe kahring e doeh telah kalvan lah ka kut ka dâw teh thoe ka kâbo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Loukloukkaang e tahloi ka kata teh, lawkcengnae ka patuep teh, ka tarannaw koe moi ka pathung han. Kai na kahmuhmanaw koe kamculah ka pathung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka palanaw hah thipaling hoi ka paruisak vaiteh, ka tahloi ni a moi a ca han. Thei lah kaawm e sannaw e thipaling hoi taranbawinaw e a lû a ca pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jentel miphunnaw nangmouh ni Cathut e a taminaw hoi lung rei hawi awh haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, kaie sannaw theinae yon hoi kâki lah runae ka rek teh, a tarannaw koe yon moipathung han toe. A ram hoi a taminaw yontha pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mosi hoi Nun capa Joshua a tho roi teh hete la lawknaw pueng hah tami pueng koe a dei pouh roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hottelah hete lawknaw Mosi ni Isarelnaw koe he a dei hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nangmouh koe sahnin ka pâpho e lawknaw pueng heh na lungthung pâkuem awh. Na canaw ni hete kâlawk pueng hah a tarawi awh nahanelah, ahnimouh koe bout dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hete hno heh rumram e nahoeh, nangmouh na hringnae hoi kâkuen e doeh. Jordan palang na raka awh teh na pang awh hane ram dawk hete hno na tarawi pawiteh, na hring a saw awh han telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hot hnin vah BAWIPA ni Jeriko namran Moab ram Abiram monrui Nebo monsom a luen teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Isarelnaw hah kai ni ka poe e ram hah khenhaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Na hmau Aron teh Hor mon vah a due teh a taminaw a kamkhuengnae koe a pha e patetlah nang hai na luennae hete mon dawk dout nateh na taminaw kamkhuengnae koe phat lawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh ni Zin thingyeiyawn, Kadesh kho Meribah tui teng vah, Isarelnaw hmalah kai barinae tawn laipalah na yon awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Isarelnaw koe ka poe e ram hah nang ni na mit hoi na hmu nakunghai, hote ram dawk na kâen mahoeh telah Mosi koe a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BAWIPA e tami Mosi ni a due hoehnahlan Isarelnaw yawhawi a poenae lawk hateh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA teh Sinai mon hoi a tho. Seir mon koehoi Isarelnaw koe kanî patetlah a tâco teh, Paran mon koehoi raeng ni pheng a tue. Tami kathoung moikapap hoi rei a tho awh. Isarelnaw hanelah aranglae kut dawk hoi kâlawk hmai a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atangcalah BAWIPA ni a taminaw hah a lungpataw. A tami kathoungnaw pueng teh na kut dawk doeh ao awh. Ahnimouh ni na khok koe a tabo awh teh, na lawk hah a dâw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi ni kaimouh hanelah kâlawk na poe awh. Jakop miphunnaw e râw lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Taminaw kahrawikungnaw teh Isarelnaw hoi rei a kamkhueng awh toteh, Jeshurun khovah nang teh siangpahrang lah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben teh dout laipalah hring naseh. A taminaw pung naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Oe BAWIPA Judah e a lawk na thai teh a hmaunawngha aonae koe thokhai haw, a kutnaw hah thapoe haw. Tarannaw kut dawk hoi rungngang haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levih miphun hanelah a dei e teh, nange Thummim hoi nange Urim teh Massah vah na tanouk teh, Meribah tui teng vah na taran e na tami kathoungnaw koe poe haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A manu hoi a na pa koevah ka hmawt boihoeh ka tet e ni, a hmaunawngha hah nout hoeh. A canaw hai panuek hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na lawk a ngâi awh teh na lawkkam hah a tarawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni nange lawkcengnaenaw hah Jakop miphun koe thoseh, na kâlawk hah Isarelnaw koe thoseh a cangkhai awh han. Ahnimouh ni hmuitui hah na hmalah thoseh, abuemlah hmaisawi thuengnae hah thuengnae khoungroe dawk thoseh a ta awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oe BAWIPA, ahnie hnopai hah yawhawi na poe teh a kut hoi a sak e hah dâw pouh haw. Ahnimouh kahmawt ngaihoeh naw a kâroe thai hoeh nahanlah ahnimae a keng hah khoe pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin miphun hanelah a dei e teh, BAWIPA ka pahren e teh, BAWIPA koe karoumcalah ao han. Pou ramuk vaiteh, a loung rahak vah a ta han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joseph miphun hanelah a dei e teh, ahnie a ram teh aphu kaawm e kalvan e hno, tadamtui hoi rahimlah kaawm e adungnae koe e tui hoi cungtalah yawhawinae poe naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kanî koehoi e aphu kaawm hnonaw hoi thoseh, thapa koehoi e aphu kaawm hnonaw hoi thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ayan e monnaw dawk e kahawipoung e hnonaw hoi thoseh, pou kangning e monruinaw e aphu kaawm hnonaw hoi thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />talai dawk e aphu kaawm e hno, hote kuepnae hoi hmai ka kang e buruk dawk kaawm e pahrennae hoi thoseh, yawhawinae na poe seh. Yawhawinae teh Joseph e lû van thoseh, a hmaunawnghanaw dawk kacuenaw e lû van bawilakhung dawk thoseh, phat lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A raimonae teh maito camin a lentoenae patetlah, a kinaw teh Savitannaw e kinaw patetlah awm lawiseh. Hot ni vah miphun pueng hah talai pout totouh a deng han. Ahnimouh teh Ephraim 10,000, Manasseh 1,000 touh lah ao a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Zebulun, na tâconae dawk hai thoseh, Issakhar, na rim dawk hai thoseh, lunghawi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni miphunnaw hah mon koe kaw awh vaiteh, hote hmuen koe nei thuengnae hah a thueng awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tuipui bawirengnae hoi sadi thung kâhrawk e hnonaw hah a rasa awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Gadnaw ka pakaw e teh a yawkahawi e lah awm naseh. Hote miphun teh sendek manu patetlah ao vaiteh, kutbuembue hoi lû vuen hah a hlip han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahni teh ama hanelah kahawipoung e a kârawi toe. Atangcalah kâlawkkapoekung e ham hah hote hmuen koe aloukcalah a ta pouh toe. BAWIPA e lannae hoi lawkcengnae hah Isarel miphun hoi cungtalah a tawk telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Dan teh sendekca lah ao teh Bashan kho hoi a dawkcawk han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphtali miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Oe Naphtali, pahren e lah na o teh, BAWIPA e yawhawinae hoi kaw sak lah na o teh, kanîloumlae hoi akalae hah coe loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asher miphun hanelah a dei e teh, Asher teh canaw e lathueng vah yawhawinae hoe a coe. Ahni teh a hmaunawnghanaw lahoi yawhawi poe e lah ao teh, a khok hah satui dawk ranup naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nange longkha tarennae teh sum hoi rahum lah ao vaiteh, na hringyung thung na thayung lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang kabawp hanelah kalvannaw ka kâcui niteh, lentoenae hoi tâmainaw dawk ka kâcuie Jeshurun Cathut patetlah apihai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A yungyoe Cathut teh na kângue e lah ao teh, a thaonae kut hoi nang teh na doun. Ahni ni, na tarannaw hah na hmalah hoi na pâlei pouh teh, raphoenae kâ hah na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isarel miphun teh a hlout vaiteh, amamouh dueng ao awh han. Jakop catoun teh cakang, misurtui hoi kakawi e ram dawk hmuen a tawn awh vaiteh, kalvan hoi tadamtui hai a bo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Oe Isarel miphun na yawhawi. BAWIPA ni a rungngang e miphun, nang teh api hoi maw na kâvan. Hote BAWIPA teh nang na ka ngue e bahling, na taluenae tahloi lah ao. Na tarannaw teh, na hmalah a sung awh vaiteh, nang ni ahnimae hmuen rasangnae koe na coukdouk awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Mosi ni Moab tanghling koehoi a cei teh, Jeriko khopui namranlah Nebo mon Pisgah monsom vah a luen. BAWIPA ni ram pueng hah a pâtue. Gilead ram Dan kho totouh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Napthali ram buemlah, Ephraim ram hoi Manasseh ram buemlah, Judah ram pueng tuipui kanîloumlah totouh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />akalae ram hoi ungkung kho tie Jeriko khopui yawn Zoar kho totouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA ni hete ram teh Abraham, Isak, Jakop tinaw koevah na catounnaw ka poe han telah thoebo laihoi lawk ka kam e ram doeh. Na mit hoi hmunae kâ teh na poe, hatei, nang teh hote ram koe na cet mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni a dei e patetlah Mosi teh Moab ram dawkvah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethpeor namran lah Moab tanghling dawk ahni teh a pakawp. Hatei, sahnin ditouh ahni pakawpnae hmuen hah apinihai panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi a due navah a kum 120 touh a pha. A mit hai mom hoeh, a tha hai youn hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isarelnaw ni Mosi teh Moab tanghling dawk hnin 30 touh a khuikakhai awh. Hottelah hoi Mosi khuikakhainae hnin teh a pout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi Nun capa Joshua teh lungangnae muitha hoi a kawi. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Mosi ni ahnie van vah a kut a toung pouh. BAWIPA ni Mosi koe lawk a poe e patetlah a sak teh, Isarelnaw ni ahnie lawk a ngâi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA ni minhmai rek kâhmo laihoi a panue e Mosi patetlah Isarel miphun dawk bangpatet e profet hai bout tâcawt hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Faro e hmaitung hoi a sannaw pueng e hmaitung hoi a ram thung pueng hanelah, Izip ram dawk sak hanelah BAWIPA ni a patoun e mitnoutnae hoi kângairu hnonaw hah ahni ni a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thaonae bahu pueng hoi Mosi ni a sak e takikatho e kângairu hno pueng hah Isarelnaw hmaitung vah Mosi ni a sak.
  </para>
</usx>
